Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.84,0:03:05.37,ENG,3,0,0,0,,Captain's Log. Stardate 8130.3.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:08.57,ENG,4,0,0,0,,Starship Enterprise on training mission to Gamma Hydra.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.78,0:03:14.48,ENG,5,0,0,0,,Section 14, coordinates: 22/87/4.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.66,0:03:19.62,ENG,6,0,0,0,,Approaching Neutral Zone, all systems normal and functioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.79,0:03:23.42,ENG,7,0,0,0,,Leaving Section 14 for Section 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.60,0:03:28.33,ENG,8,0,0,0,,Stand by. Project parabolic course to avoid entering Neutral Zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.01,0:03:32.50,ENG,9,0,0,0,,Course change projected.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.67,0:03:35.44,ENG,10,0,0,0,,Captain! I'm getting something on the distress channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.64,0:03:41.48,ENG,11,0,0,0,,Imperative! This is the Kobayashi Maru, 19 periods out of Altair Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.65,0:03:44.74,ENG,12,0,0,0,,We have struck a gravitic mine and have lost all power...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.82,0:03:54.28,ENG,13,0,0,0,,This is the Starship Enterprise. Can you give us your coordinates?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.46,0:03:57.66,ENG,14,0,0,0,,Enterprise, our position is Gamma Hydra, Section 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.97,0:04:00.23,ENG,15,0,0,0,,In the Neutral Zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.40,0:04:05.34,ENG,16,0,0,0,,Hull penetrated, life support systems failing. Can you assist us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.51,0:04:07.17,ENG,17,0,0,0,,Data on Kobayashi Maru.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.34,0:04:13.01,ENG,18,0,0,0,,Third class neutronic fuel carrier, crew of 81.300 passengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.48,0:04:15.51,ENG,19,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.18,0:04:20.42,ENG,20,0,0,0,,Mr Sulu? Plot an intercept course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:25.02,ENG,21,0,0,0,,May l remind the Captain that if a Starship enters the Zone...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.19,0:04:28.06,ENG,22,0,0,0,,I'm aware of my responsibilities, Mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.20,0:04:35.96,ENG,23,0,0,0,,Estimating two minutes to intercept.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.14,0:04:43.67,ENG,24,0,0,0,,- Now entering the Neu tral Zone. - Warning. Neutral Zone entered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.41,0:04:46.64,ENG,25,0,0,0,,We are now in violation of Treaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.85,0:04:49.78,ENG,26,0,0,0,,Stand by, Transporter Room, ready to beam survivors aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.95,0:04:52.71,ENG,27,0,0,0,,Captain! l've lost their signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.19,0:04:57.49,ENG,28,0,0,0,,Sensors indicate three Klingon cruisers, bearing 316 mark 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.66,0:04:59.79,ENG,29,0,0,0,,- Closing fast. - Visual.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.06,0:05:03.19,ENG,30,0,0,0,,Battle stations! Activate shields!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.63,0:05:07.90,ENG,31,0,0,0,,- Shields activated! - Say we are on a rescue mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.07,0:05:12.06,ENG,32,0,0,0,,- They're jamming all frequencies. - Klingons on attack course...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.77,0:05:15.50,ENG,33,0,0,0,,We're in over our heads. Mr Sulu! Get us out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.68,0:05:20.41,ENG,34,0,0,0,,Alert! Klingon torpedoes activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.61,0:05:22.61,ENG,35,0,0,0,,Evasive action!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.99,0:05:30.08,ENG,36,0,0,0,,- Engineering! Damage report! - Main energiser hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.26,0:05:33.25,ENG,37,0,0,0,,Engage auxiliary power! Prepare to return fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.53,0:05:38.66,ENG,38,0,0,0,,Shields collapsing, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.37,0:05:45.63,ENG,39,0,0,0,,- Fire all phasers! - No power to the weapons, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.54,0:05:53.71,ENG,40,0,0,0,,Captain, it's no use! We're dead in space!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.78,0:06:00.31,ENG,41,0,0,0,,Activate escape pods! Send out the Log Buoy. All hands abandon ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.52,0:06:02.22,ENG,42,0,0,0,,All right. Open her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.23,0:06:15.00,ENG,43,0,0,0,,- Any suggestions, Admiral? - Prayer, Mr Saavik.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.17,0:06:17.64,ENG,44,0,0,0,,The Klingons don't take prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.84,0:06:20.64,ENG,45,0,0,0,,Lights!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.81,0:06:22.50,ENG,46,0,0,0,,Motors on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.91,0:06:26.44,ENG,47,0,0,0,,Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.75,0:06:33.72,ENG,48,0,0,0,,Trainees...to the briefing room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:38.08,ENG,49,0,0,0,,Maintenance Crew, report to Bridge Simulator.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.26,0:06:41.25,ENG,50,0,0,0,,Maintenance Crew, report to Bridge Simulator.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.43,0:06:44.96,ENG,51,0,0,0,,- Physician, heal thyself. - ls that all you've got to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.13,0:06:48.00,ENG,52,0,0,0,,- What about my performance? - l'm not a drama critic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.60,0:06:52.54,ENG,53,0,0,0,,Are you gonna stay with the sinking ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.71,0:06:56.30,ENG,54,0,0,0,,- Permission to speak candidly, sir? - Granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.48,0:07:00.17,ENG,55,0,0,0,,I don't believe this was a fair test of my command abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.38,0:07:03.35,ENG,56,0,0,0,,There was no way to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.55,0:07:06.42,ENG,57,0,0,0,,Every commander may face a no-win situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.59,0:07:10.68,ENG,58,0,0,0,,- Has that never occurred to you? - No, sir. lt has not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.86,0:07:16.63,ENG,59,0,0,0,,How we deal with death is at least as important as how we deal with life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.80,0:07:19.99,ENG,60,0,0,0,,As l indicated, that thought had not occurred to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.17,0:07:22.83,ENG,61,0,0,0,,Well, now you have something new to think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.11,0:07:31.37,ENG,62,0,0,0,,Admiral? Wouldn't it be easier to put an experienced crew back on the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.55,0:07:35.28,ENG,63,0,0,0,,Galloping around the cosmos is a game for the young, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.32,0:07:38.72,ENG,64,0,0,0,,What is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.69,0:07:47.46,ENG,65,0,0,0,,Aren't you dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.23,0:07:54.22,ENG,66,0,0,0,,You want to learn what efficiency rating l'll give your cadets?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.40,0:07:57.00,ENG,67,0,0,0,,I am understandably curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.17,0:08:00.54,ENG,68,0,0,0,,They destroyed the Simulator Room and you with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.71,0:08:03.40,ENG,69,0,0,0,,The Kobayashi Maru scenario frequently wreaks havoc
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.58,0:08:09.52,ENG,70,0,0,0,,with students and equipment. You took the test three times yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.68,0:08:13.02,ENG,71,0,0,0,,Your final solution was, shall we say...unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.19,0:08:15.75,ENG,72,0,0,0,,It had the virtue of never having been tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.92,0:08:19.42,ENG,73,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way...thank you for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.59,0:08:21.99,ENG,74,0,0,0,,I know of your fondness for antiques.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.66,0:08:27.76,ENG,75,0,0,0,,''lt was the best of times, it was the worst of times...''
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.94,0:08:31.00,ENG,76,0,0,0,,- Message, Spock? - None that l'm conscious of.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.17,0:08:35.57,ENG,77,0,0,0,,Except, of course, happy birthday. Surely, the best of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.74,0:08:40.77,ENG,78,0,0,0,,Captain Spock, Captain Spock, space shuttle leaving in 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.98,0:08:43.01,ENG,79,0,0,0,,- Where are you off to? - The Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.22,0:08:46.65,ENG,80,0,0,0,,I must check in before your inspection. And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.69,0:08:50.45,ENG,81,0,0,0,,Home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.07,0:09:10.44,ENG,82,0,0,0,,Doctor! What beams you into this neck of the woods?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.61,0:09:13.44,ENG,83,0,0,0,,''Beware of Romulans bearing gifts.''
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.85,0:09:18.72,ENG,84,0,0,0,,- Happy birthday, Jim! - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.82,0:09:24.99,ENG,85,0,0,0,,Romulan ale! Bones, you know this is illegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.16,0:09:28.49,ENG,86,0,0,0,,I only use it for medicinal purposes. l got aboard a ship
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.66,0:09:31.83,ENG,87,0,0,0,,that brings in a case now and then across the Neutral Zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.00,0:09:34.52,ENG,88,0,0,0,,- Now, don't be a prig. - 2283.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:37.86,ENG,89,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, it takes this stuff a while to ferment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.04,0:09:41.87,ENG,90,0,0,0,,Here, give me that. Now, you open this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.91,0:09:44.97,ENG,91,0,0,0,,I'm almost afraid to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.18,0:09:48.41,ENG,92,0,0,0,,What is it? Klingon aphrodisiacs?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.62,0:09:50.08,ENG,93,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.28,0:09:54.85,ENG,94,0,0,0,,Bones, this is charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.02,0:09:59.05,ENG,95,0,0,0,,For most patients your age, l recommend Retinax Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.23,0:10:02.49,ENG,96,0,0,0,,- l'm allergic to Retinax. - Exactly. Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.66,0:10:04.26,ENG,97,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.64,0:10:15.37,ENG,98,0,0,0,,Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.51,0:10:21.35,ENG,99,0,0,0,,- l don't know what to say. - You could say thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.55,0:10:23.02,ENG,100,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.62,0:10:31.52,ENG,101,0,0,0,,Damn it, Jim! What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.69,0:10:34.29,ENG,102,0,0,0,,Why are we treating your birthday like a funeral?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.46,0:10:38.86,ENG,103,0,0,0,,- Bones, l don't want to be lectured. - What the hell do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.57,0:10:46.56,ENG,104,0,0,0,,This is not about age. And you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.74,0:10:50.97,ENG,105,0,0,0,,It's about you flying a computer when you want to be hopping galaxies!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.14,0:10:54.20,ENG,106,0,0,0,,Spare me your notions of poetry. We all have our duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.41,0:11:00.94,ENG,107,0,0,0,,Bull! You're hiding, hiding behind rules and regulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.52,0:11:05.42,ENG,108,0,0,0,,- Who am l hiding from? - From yourself, Admiral!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.53,0:11:14.80,ENG,109,0,0,0,,Don't mince words, Bones. What do you really think?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.64,0:11:19.90,ENG,110,0,0,0,,Jim...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.24,0:11:24.61,ENG,111,0,0,0,,I'm your doctor and l'm your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.75,0:11:28.31,ENG,112,0,0,0,,Get back your command.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.52,0:11:31.88,ENG,113,0,0,0,,Get it back before you turn into part of this collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.52,0:11:36.18,ENG,114,0,0,0,,Before you really do grow old.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.07,0:11:56.53,ENG,115,0,0,0,,Starship Log. Stardate 8130.4.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.71,0:11:59.44,ENG,116,0,0,0,,Log Entry by First Officer Pavel Chekov.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.65,0:12:03.17,ENG,117,0,0,0,,Starship Reliant on orbital approach to Ceti Alpha Six,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.38,0:12:05.94,ENG,118,0,0,0,,in connection with Project Genesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.15,0:12:09.78,ENG,119,0,0,0,,We keep searching for a lifeless planet, to satisfy the requirements
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:14.19,ENG,120,0,0,0,,of a test site for the Genesis Experiment. So far, no success.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.36,0:12:19.23,ENG,121,0,0,0,,Standard orbit, please. Mr Beach, any change in the surface scan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.40,0:12:24.43,ENG,122,0,0,0,,Negative. Limited atmosphere dominated by craylon gas, sand,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.60,0:12:28.23,ENG,123,0,0,0,,high velocity winds. lncapable of supporting life forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.01,0:12:32.14,ENG,124,0,0,0,,Does it have to be completely lifeless?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.35,0:12:34.47,ENG,125,0,0,0,,You've found something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.68,0:12:39.02,ENG,126,0,0,0,,We've picked up a minor energy flux reading on one dyno scanner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.19,0:12:43.42,ENG,127,0,0,0,,Damn. Are you sure? Maybe the scanner's out of adjustment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.82,0:12:47.89,ENG,128,0,0,0,,I suppose it could be a particle of pre-animate matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.06,0:12:50.39,ENG,129,0,0,0,,caught in the matrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.56,0:12:53.90,ENG,130,0,0,0,,All right. Get on the Comm-pic to Dr Marcus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.17,0:12:58.87,ENG,131,0,0,0,,Maybe it's something we can transplant?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.04,0:13:01.06,ENG,132,0,0,0,,You know what she'll say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.24,0:13:06.08,ENG,133,0,0,0,,Now, let me get this straight. Something you can transplant?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.28,0:13:08.65,ENG,134,0,0,0,,Something you can transplant?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.98,0:13:12.65,ENG,135,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.82,0:13:15.45,ENG,136,0,0,0,,It may only be a particle of pre-animate matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:20.22,ENG,137,0,0,0,,Then again, it may not. You boys have to be clear on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.39,0:13:23.92,ENG,138,0,0,0,,There can't be so much as a microbe, or the show's off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.10,0:13:27.43,ENG,139,0,0,0,,Have a look. But if it is something that can be moved...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.60,0:13:29.40,ENG,140,0,0,0,,You bet, Doctor. We're on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.88,0:13:37.44,ENG,141,0,0,0,,Don't have kittens, Genesis is going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.58,0:13:41.01,ENG,142,0,0,0,,They'll remember you in one breath with Newton, Einstein, Surak!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.18,0:13:44.17,ENG,143,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot. No respect from my offspring.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.38,0:13:48.18,ENG,144,0,0,0,,Par for the course. Are you teaming up with me for bridge after dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.36,0:13:50.05,ENG,145,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.22,0:13:51.92,ENG,146,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.23,0:13:56.89,ENG,147,0,0,0,,Every time we have dealings with Starfleet, l get nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.10,0:14:00.62,ENG,148,0,0,0,,We are dealing with something that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.80,0:14:03.93,ENG,149,0,0,0,,...could be perverted into a dreadful weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.61,0:14:09.44,ENG,150,0,0,0,,That overgrown Boy Scout you used to know is exactly the kind of man...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.61,0:14:15.78,ENG,151,0,0,0,,Jim Kirk was many things, but he was never a Boy Scout!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.85,0:14:20.48,ENG,152,0,0,0,,Captain Terrell, stand by to beam down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.53,0:14:38.30,ENG,153,0,0,0,,Chekov, are you sure these are the correct coordinates?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.47,0:14:42.84,ENG,154,0,0,0,,Captain, this is the garden spot of Ceti Alpha Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.48,0:14:46.54,ENG,155,0,0,0,,I can barely see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.99,0:15:00.86,ENG,156,0,0,0,,There's nothing here! The Tricorder must be broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.57,0:15:17.07,ENG,157,0,0,0,,Chekov! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.38,0:15:26.38,ENG,158,0,0,0,,Those look like cargo carriers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.40,0:15:38.73,ENG,159,0,0,0,,Hey, give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.10,0:16:20.23,ENG,160,0,0,0,,What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.41,0:16:23.31,ENG,161,0,0,0,,If they crashed, where's the rest of the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.36,0:16:39.05,ENG,162,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.24,0:16:51.97,ENG,163,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.14,0:16:53.97,ENG,164,0,0,0,,Botany Bay...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.31,0:16:57.21,ENG,165,0,0,0,,Botany Bay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.21,0:17:00.08,ENG,166,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.15,0:17:03.14,ENG,167,0,0,0,,We've got to get out of here now! Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.35,0:17:06.34,ENG,168,0,0,0,,- What about the... - Never mind that! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.55,0:17:09.11,ENG,169,0,0,0,,Chekov, what's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.29,0:17:10.48,ENG,170,0,0,0,,Chekov!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.52,0:17:13.32,ENG,171,0,0,0,,Come on! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.24,0:17:30.90,ENG,172,0,0,0,,Starship Reliant to Captain Terrell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.08,0:17:34.10,ENG,173,0,0,0,,This is Commander Kyle. Will you please respond, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.25,0:17:39.22,ENG,174,0,0,0,,Captain Terrell! Respond, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.92,0:17:46.69,ENG,175,0,0,0,,Let's give them a little more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:21.72,ENG,176,0,0,0,,Khan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.94,0:18:38.74,ENG,177,0,0,0,,I don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.29,0:18:48.08,ENG,178,0,0,0,,But you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.26,0:18:51.59,ENG,179,0,0,0,,I never forget a face.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.76,0:18:53.09,ENG,180,0,0,0,,Mister...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.23,0:18:56.82,ENG,181,0,0,0,,...Chekov!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.00,0:18:59.46,ENG,182,0,0,0,,Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.57,0:19:05.06,ENG,183,0,0,0,,I'd never thought to see your face again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.24,0:19:08.77,ENG,184,0,0,0,,- Chekov, who is this man? - A criminal, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.94,0:19:12.38,ENG,185,0,0,0,,A product of late 20th century genetic engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.58,0:19:15.95,ENG,186,0,0,0,,- What do you want? Sir, l demand... - You are in a position
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.12,0:19:18.88,ENG,187,0,0,0,,to demand nothing, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.69,0:19:26.72,ENG,188,0,0,0,,I, on the other hand, am in a position to grant...nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.89,0:19:31.09,ENG,189,0,0,0,,What you see is all that remains of the ship's company and crew
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.26,0:19:33.29,ENG,190,0,0,0,,of the Botany Bay...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.47,0:19:39.06,ENG,191,0,0,0,,...marooned here 15 years ago by Captain James T. Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.24,0:19:42.57,ENG,192,0,0,0,,- Listen! You men and women... - Captain! Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.88,0:19:48.87,ENG,193,0,0,0,,Save your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.75,0:19:54.15,ENG,194,0,0,0,,These people have sworn to live and die at my command
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.32,0:19:57.26,ENG,195,0,0,0,,200 years before you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.63,0:20:01.86,ENG,196,0,0,0,,Do you mean... he never told you the tale?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.53,0:20:06.06,ENG,197,0,0,0,,To amuse your captain? No?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.74,0:20:12.76,ENG,198,0,0,0,,Never told how the Enterprise picked up the Botany Bay, lost in space,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.94,0:20:18.74,ENG,199,0,0,0,,in the year 1996, myself and the ship's company in cryogenic freeze?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.91,0:20:21.85,ENG,200,0,0,0,,- l've never even met Admiral Kirk. - Admiral?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.95,0:20:24.31,ENG,201,0,0,0,,Admiral?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.49,0:20:26.92,ENG,202,0,0,0,,Admiral...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.62,0:20:37.96,ENG,203,0,0,0,,Never told you how... Admiral Kirk sent 70 of us into exile
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.13,0:20:41.29,ENG,204,0,0,0,,on this barren sand heap,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.47,0:20:46.03,ENG,205,0,0,0,,with only the contents of these cargo bays to sustain us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.21,0:20:49.87,ENG,206,0,0,0,,You lie! On Ceti Alpha Five there was life!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.04,0:20:53.17,ENG,207,0,0,0,,- A fair chance! - This is Ceti Alpha Five!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.92,0:21:08.35,ENG,208,0,0,0,,Ceti Alpha Six exploded six months after we were left here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.43,0:21:15.10,ENG,209,0,0,0,,The shock shifted the orbit of this planet and everything was laid waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.27,0:21:20.43,ENG,210,0,0,0,,Admiral Kirk...never bothered to check on our progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.94,0:21:29.04,ENG,211,0,0,0,,It was only the fact of my genetically engineered intellect
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.25,0:21:31.65,ENG,212,0,0,0,,that allowed us to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.02,0:21:37.51,ENG,213,0,0,0,,On Earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.13,0:21:42.29,ENG,214,0,0,0,,...200 years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.56,0:21:45.83,ENG,215,0,0,0,,...l was a prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.67,0:21:49.73,ENG,216,0,0,0,,...with power over millions!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.90,0:21:54.31,ENG,217,0,0,0,,Captain Kirk was your host! You repaid his hospitality
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.47,0:21:57.77,ENG,218,0,0,0,,by trying to steal his ship and murder him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.39,0:22:10.75,ENG,219,0,0,0,,You didn't expect to find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.92,0:22:15.42,ENG,220,0,0,0,,You thought this was... Ceti Alpha Six!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.83,0:22:22.13,ENG,221,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.11,0:22:33.48,ENG,222,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.02,0:22:45.25,ENG,223,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce you to Ceti Alpha Five's only remaining
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.43,0:22:48.59,ENG,224,0,0,0,,indigenous life form.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.97,0:23:02.34,ENG,225,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.51,0:23:04.81,ENG,226,0,0,0,,They've killed 20 of my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.68,0:23:09.34,ENG,227,0,0,0,,Including my beloved wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.20,0:23:27.33,ENG,228,0,0,0,,Oh, not all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.04,0:23:35.13,ENG,229,0,0,0,,And not...instantly, to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.82,0:23:52.59,ENG,230,0,0,0,,You see, their young enter through the ears...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.76,0:23:56.32,ENG,231,0,0,0,,...and wrap themselves around the cerebral cortex.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.50,0:24:00.26,ENG,232,0,0,0,,This has the effect of rendering the victim extremely susceptible
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.43,0:24:02.42,ENG,233,0,0,0,,to suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.50,0:24:08.00,ENG,234,0,0,0,,Later, as they...grow...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.01,0:24:12.07,ENG,235,0,0,0,,...follows madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.01,0:24:16.04,ENG,236,0,0,0,,And death.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.56,0:24:25.49,ENG,237,0,0,0,,Khan! Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.66,0:24:29.12,ENG,238,0,0,0,,These are pets, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.90,0:24:35.49,ENG,239,0,0,0,,Not quite domesticated.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.50,0:24:40.17,ENG,240,0,0,0,,Khan... Captain Kirk was only doing his duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.21,0:24:42.94,ENG,241,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.77,0:25:11.40,ENG,242,0,0,0,,That's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.27,0:25:17.71,ENG,243,0,0,0,,Now, tell me... Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.88,0:25:20.90,ENG,244,0,0,0,,And tell me where l may find...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.01,0:25:23.95,ENG,245,0,0,0,,...James Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.29,0:25:29.25,ENG,246,0,0,0,,Enterprise to Admiral Kirk's shuttle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.42,0:25:33.12,ENG,247,0,0,0,,You're cleared for docking. Approach portside torpedo bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.23,0:25:39.53,ENG,248,0,0,0,,Enterprise, this is Admiral Kirk's party on final approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.70,0:25:42.76,ENG,249,0,0,0,,Enterprise welcomes you. Prepare for docking.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.12,0:25:59.08,ENG,250,0,0,0,,I hate inspections.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.39,0:26:04.19,ENG,251,0,0,0,,I'm delighted. Any chance to go aboard the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.57,0:26:16.90,ENG,252,0,0,0,,I am glad to have you at the helm for three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.07,0:26:18.63,ENG,253,0,0,0,,I don't think these kids can steer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.99,0:26:37.75,ENG,254,0,0,0,,Open the airlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.93,0:26:43.06,ENG,255,0,0,0,,- Permission to come aboard, Captain. - Welcome. You know my training crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.23,0:26:45.22,ENG,256,0,0,0,,They certainly know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.40,0:26:48.16,ENG,257,0,0,0,,Yes. We've been through death and life together.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.67,0:26:55.94,ENG,258,0,0,0,,Mr Scott, you old space dog! You're well?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.11,0:26:59.60,ENG,259,0,0,0,,I had a wee bout, sir, but Dr McCoy pulled me through.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.81,0:27:03.27,ENG,260,0,0,0,,- A wee bout of what? - Shore leave, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.79,0:27:09.08,ENG,261,0,0,0,,- And who is this? - Midshipman First Class.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.26,0:27:13.16,ENG,262,0,0,0,,- Peter Preston, engineer's mate! - First training voyage?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.33,0:27:15.76,ENG,263,0,0,0,,- Yes, sir! - l see.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.16,0:27:20.33,ENG,264,0,0,0,,Well...shall we start with the Engine Room?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.50,0:27:22.76,ENG,265,0,0,0,,We'll see you there. Everything is in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.94,0:27:25.40,ENG,266,0,0,0,,That'll be a pleasant surprise, Mr Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.44,0:27:31.04,ENG,267,0,0,0,,I'll see you on the bridge, Admiral. Company dismissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.32,0:27:43.55,ENG,268,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.72,0:27:46.66,ENG,269,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.83,0:27:49.95,ENG,270,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.13,0:27:52.65,ENG,271,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.13,0:28:28.09,ENG,272,0,0,0,,Well, Mr Scott, are your cadets capable of handling a minor training cruise?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.27,0:28:31.86,ENG,273,0,0,0,,- Give the word, Admiral! - Mr Scott, the word is given.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.91,0:28:35.97,ENG,274,0,0,0,,Admiral, what about the rest of the inspection?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.14,0:28:38.11,ENG,275,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.86,0:28:54.05,ENG,276,0,0,0,,This is Starfleet Operations. Enterprise is cleared for departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.23,0:28:56.13,ENG,277,0,0,0,,Admiral on the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.18,0:29:15.58,ENG,278,0,0,0,,Very well, Mr Saavik. You may clear all moorings.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.42,0:29:21.22,ENG,279,0,0,0,,- All moorings are clear, Captain. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.99,0:29:30.16,ENG,280,0,0,0,,Lieutenant? Have you ever piloted a Starship out of spacedock?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.16,0:29:33.56,ENG,281,0,0,0,,Never, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.84,0:29:44.50,ENG,282,0,0,0,,Take her out, Mr Saavik.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.41,0:29:48.85,ENG,283,0,0,0,,Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.52,0:30:01.55,ENG,284,0,0,0,,For everything there is a first time, Lieutenant. Don't you agree, Admiral?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.60,0:30:05.46,ENG,285,0,0,0,,- Aft thrusters, Mr Sulu. - Aft thrusters.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.73,0:30:11.40,ENG,286,0,0,0,,- Would you like a tranquilliser? - Ahead one quarter impulse power.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.04,0:31:27.27,ENG,287,0,0,0,,- We are free and clear to navigate. - Course heading, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.48,0:31:30.57,ENG,288,0,0,0,,Captain's discretion.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.28,0:31:36.15,ENG,289,0,0,0,,Mr Sulu? You may...indulge yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.36,0:31:38.79,ENG,290,0,0,0,,Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.92,0:32:06.18,ENG,291,0,0,0,,That about do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.35,0:32:10.12,ENG,292,0,0,0,,There can't be more information we could squeeze into the memory banks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.26,0:32:14.06,ENG,293,0,0,0,,- Next time we'll design a bigger one. - Who'd build it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.23,0:32:18.46,ENG,294,0,0,0,,Dr Marcus? Comm-Pic coming in on hyperchannel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.63,0:32:23.03,ENG,295,0,0,0,,- It's the Starship Reliant. - On the screen, please, Jedda.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.20,0:32:26.97,ENG,296,0,0,0,,Come in, please. This is the Reliant calling Regula One.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.77,0:32:32.07,ENG,297,0,0,0,,Repeat, this is USS Reliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.24,0:32:36.04,ENG,298,0,0,0,,Commander, we are receiving. This is Regula One. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.25,0:32:42.31,ENG,299,0,0,0,,Dr Marcus. We're en route to you and should be there in three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.49,0:32:47.02,ENG,300,0,0,0,,En route? Why? We weren't expecting you for another three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.19,0:32:52.26,ENG,301,0,0,0,,- Has something happened? - Ceti Alpha Six has checked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.77,0:32:56.57,ENG,302,0,0,0,,- Then l don't understand why you... - We have received new orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.74,0:33:01.26,ENG,303,0,0,0,,Upon our arrival at Regula One, all materials of Project Genesis
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.44,0:33:05.71,ENG,304,0,0,0,,will be transferred to this ship for testing on Ceti Alpha Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.88,0:33:08.28,ENG,305,0,0,0,,Who the hell do they think they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.48,0:33:11.88,ENG,306,0,0,0,,Commander Chekov, this is completely irregular.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.02,0:33:16.61,ENG,307,0,0,0,,- l have my orders. - Pin him down, Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.79,0:33:17.95,ENG,308,0,0,0,,Who gave the order?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.36,0:33:25.66,ENG,309,0,0,0,,The order comes from... Admiral James T. Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.83,0:33:28.80,ENG,310,0,0,0,,I knew it! All along the military's wanted to get...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.97,0:33:31.90,ENG,311,0,0,0,,This is completely improper, Commander Chekov!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.07,0:33:36.24,ENG,312,0,0,0,,I do not intend to allow Reliant or any other unauthorised personnel
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.41,0:33:38.24,ENG,313,0,0,0,,access to our work or materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.08,0:33:44.45,ENG,314,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that you feel that way. The Admiral's orders are confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.08,0:33:50.15,ENG,315,0,0,0,,Please prepare to deliver Genesis to us upon our arrival. Reliant out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.99,0:33:55.29,ENG,316,0,0,0,,Well done, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.96,0:34:00.73,ENG,317,0,0,0,,You realise, sir, they will attempt to contact Admiral Kirk
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.83,0:34:02.73,ENG,318,0,0,0,,and confirm the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.51,0:34:17.48,ENG,319,0,0,0,,Hold, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.05,0:34:21.52,ENG,320,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.42,0:34:27.48,ENG,321,0,0,0,,Lieutenant, are you wearing your hair differently?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.66,0:34:29.86,ENG,322,0,0,0,,It's still regulation, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.63,0:34:34.39,ENG,323,0,0,0,,May l speak, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.54,0:34:39.53,ENG,324,0,0,0,,Self-expression doesn't seem to be one of your problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.94,0:34:47.47,ENG,325,0,0,0,,You're bothered by your performance on the Kobayashi Maru.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.68,0:34:51.84,ENG,326,0,0,0,,- l failed to resolve the situation. - It's a test of character.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.25,0:34:55.95,ENG,327,0,0,0,,May l ask how you dealt with the test?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.59,0:35:00.32,ENG,328,0,0,0,,You may ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.96,0:35:05.02,ENG,329,0,0,0,,That's a little joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.20,0:35:08.66,ENG,330,0,0,0,,Humour. lt is a difficult concept.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.74,0:35:14.47,ENG,331,0,0,0,,- lt is not logical. - We learn by doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.64,0:35:17.13,ENG,332,0,0,0,,Who's been holding up the damn elevator?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.55,0:35:23.11,ENG,333,0,0,0,,- Did she change her hairstyle? - l hadn't noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.32,0:35:25.98,ENG,334,0,0,0,,Wonderful stuff, that Romulan ale.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.19,0:35:29.02,ENG,335,0,0,0,,- Admiral Kirk? - Kirk here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.19,0:35:33.96,ENG,336,0,0,0,,An urgent Comm-Pic from Space Lab Regula One for you. Dr Carol Marcus.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.20,0:35:41.93,ENG,337,0,0,0,,- l'll take it in my quarters, Uhura. - lt never rains but it pours.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.04,0:35:48.60,ENG,338,0,0,0,,As a physician, you should appreciate the dangers of re-opening old wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.11,0:35:54.24,ENG,339,0,0,0,,- Sorry. - Jim, can you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.45,0:35:58.41,ENG,340,0,0,0,,I can hear you, Carol. What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.62,0:36:02.28,ENG,341,0,0,0,,Why are you taking Genesis away from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.45,0:36:06.29,ENG,342,0,0,0,,Taking Genesis? Who is taking Genesis?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.46,0:36:09.69,ENG,343,0,0,0,,- l can see you, but l can't hear. - Carol...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.86,0:36:15.20,ENG,344,0,0,0,,- Jim, did you give the order? - What order? Who is taking Genesis?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.37,0:36:21.07,ENG,345,0,0,0,,Please help us! l won't let them have Genesis without authorisation!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.24,0:36:23.40,ENG,346,0,0,0,,On whose authority can they do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.58,0:36:26.54,ENG,347,0,0,0,,- No one's authority! - Please do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.71,0:36:30.20,ENG,348,0,0,0,,- Uhura, what's happening? - Transmission jammed at source.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.45,0:36:39.15,ENG,349,0,0,0,,Alert Starfleet Headquarters. l want to talk to Starfleet Command.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.93,0:36:43.55,ENG,350,0,0,0,,We must have order in here. This has to be some sort of mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.73,0:36:47.13,ENG,351,0,0,0,,Mistake?! We're all alone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.30,0:36:50.06,ENG,352,0,0,0,,They waited until everyone was on leave to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.24,0:36:52.93,ENG,353,0,0,0,,Reliant is supposed to be at our disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.11,0:36:55.87,ENG,354,0,0,0,,- Starfleet clearly never intended... - l know that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.04,0:37:00.74,ENG,355,0,0,0,,I tried to tell you! Scientists have always been pawns of the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.88,0:37:02.47,ENG,356,0,0,0,,Starfleet has kept the peace for 100 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.68,0:37:06.52,ENG,357,0,0,0,,I cannot subscribe to your interpretation of this event!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.55,0:37:12.79,ENG,358,0,0,0,,You may be right, Doctor. But what about Reliant? She's on her way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.97,0:37:29.10,ENG,359,0,0,0,,Something may be wrong in Regula One. We've been told to investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.81,0:37:35.14,ENG,360,0,0,0,,If memory serves, Regula One is a scientific research laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.35,0:37:39.22,ENG,361,0,0,0,,I told Starfleet Command all we had was a boatload of children.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.62,0:37:43.85,ENG,362,0,0,0,,But...we're the only ship in the quadrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.19,0:37:50.56,ENG,363,0,0,0,,These cadets of yours, how will they respond under real pressure?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.73,0:37:55.22,ENG,364,0,0,0,,As with all living things, each according to his gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.40,0:37:58.13,ENG,365,0,0,0,,Of course, this ship is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.17,0:38:04.04,ENG,366,0,0,0,,No, that won't be necessary. Just get me to Regula One.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.21,0:38:09.15,ENG,367,0,0,0,,As a teacher on a training mission, l'm happy to command the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.31,0:38:15.18,ENG,368,0,0,0,,If we are to go on actual duty, the senior officer assumes command.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.35,0:38:17.19,ENG,369,0,0,0,,It may be nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.22,0:38:22.42,ENG,370,0,0,0,,Garbled communications. You take the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.59,0:38:25.93,ENG,371,0,0,0,,You proceed from a false assumption.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.97,0:38:30.53,ENG,372,0,0,0,,I'm a Vulcan. l have no ego to bruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.41,0:38:37.00,ENG,373,0,0,0,,You remind me that logic dictates your actions?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.18,0:38:40.91,ENG,374,0,0,0,,I would not remind you of that which you know so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.11,0:38:45.88,ENG,375,0,0,0,,If l may be so bold, it was a mistake for you to accept promotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.02,0:38:50.48,ENG,376,0,0,0,,Commanding a Starship is your first, best destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.69,0:38:54.59,ENG,377,0,0,0,,Anything else is a waste of material.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.76,0:38:57.42,ENG,378,0,0,0,,I would not presume to debate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.60,0:38:59.66,ENG,379,0,0,0,,That is wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.83,0:39:04.39,ENG,380,0,0,0,,In any case...were l to invoke logic, logic clearly dictates
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.57,0:39:07.40,ENG,381,0,0,0,,that the needs of the many outweigh the needs of the few.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.74,0:39:11.68,ENG,382,0,0,0,,Or the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.45,0:39:21.78,ENG,383,0,0,0,,You're my superior officer. You are also my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.95,0:39:25.15,ENG,384,0,0,0,,I have been and always shall be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.06,0:39:31.33,ENG,385,0,0,0,,Stop energisers. Prepare speakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.03,0:39:38.76,ENG,386,0,0,0,,An emergency situation has arisen. By order of Starfleet Command,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.94,0:39:42.67,ENG,387,0,0,0,,as of now, 1800 hours, l'm assuming command of this vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.11,0:39:45.63,ENG,388,0,0,0,,Duty officer, so note in the log. Plot a new course
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.81,0:39:48.30,ENG,389,0,0,0,,for Space Laboratory Regula One. Engine Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.58,0:39:53.64,ENG,390,0,0,0,,Mr Scott! We'll be going to Warp Speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.42,0:39:59.08,ENG,391,0,0,0,,- Course plotted for Regula One. - Engage Warp engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.26,0:40:02.85,ENG,392,0,0,0,,- Prepare for Warp Speed. - Ready, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.26,0:40:09.63,ENG,393,0,0,0,,I know that none of you were expecting this. l'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.80,0:40:13.20,ENG,394,0,0,0,,I'm going to have to ask you to grow up a little sooner than you expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.21,0:40:16.00,ENG,395,0,0,0,,Warp Five, Sulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.91,0:40:20.31,ENG,396,0,0,0,,So much for the little training cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.15,0:40:32.89,ENG,397,0,0,0,,Course to intercept Enterprise ready, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.06,0:40:36.08,ENG,398,0,0,0,,- Helmsman? - Sir. May l speak?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.53,0:40:43.66,ENG,399,0,0,0,,We're all with you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.84,0:40:46.39,ENG,400,0,0,0,,But consider this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.47,0:40:53.10,ENG,401,0,0,0,,We are free. We have a ship and the means to go where we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.28,0:40:56.37,ENG,402,0,0,0,,We have escaped permanent exile on Ceti Alpha Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.92,0:41:01.51,ENG,403,0,0,0,,You have proved your superior intellect...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.72,0:41:04.52,ENG,404,0,0,0,,...and defeated the plans of Admiral Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.56,0:41:08.65,ENG,405,0,0,0,,You do not need to defeat him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.83,0:41:11.39,ENG,406,0,0,0,,He tasks me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.56,0:41:14.66,ENG,407,0,0,0,,He tasks me, and l shall have him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.87,0:41:19.03,ENG,408,0,0,0,,I'll chase him round the moons of Nibia
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.20,0:41:24.67,ENG,409,0,0,0,,and round the Antares maelstrom and round perdition's flames
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.84,0:41:30.65,ENG,410,0,0,0,,before l give him up! Prepare to alter course.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.75,0:41:35.78,ENG,411,0,0,0,,Space Station Regula One, please come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.99,0:41:38.29,ENG,412,0,0,0,,Dr Marcus, please respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.79,0:41:42.89,ENG,413,0,0,0,,This is Enterprise call...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.93,0:41:46.63,ENG,414,0,0,0,,There's no response from Regula One.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.80,0:41:50.33,ENG,415,0,0,0,,- But no longer jammed? - No, sir. No nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.34,0:42:02.87,ENG,416,0,0,0,,There are two possibilities. They're unable or unwilling to respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.08,0:42:06.74,ENG,417,0,0,0,,- How far? - 12 hours 43 minutes, present speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.72,0:42:14.82,ENG,418,0,0,0,,Give up Genesis, she said. What does that mean? Give it up to whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.99,0:42:20.76,ENG,419,0,0,0,,It might help if l knew what Genesis was, beyond the biblical reference.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.93,0:42:24.03,ENG,420,0,0,0,,Uhura, have Dr McCoy join us in my quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.20,0:42:27.76,ENG,421,0,0,0,,Mr Saavik? You have the con.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.78,0:42:36.80,ENG,422,0,0,0,,I've got Sick Bay ready. Will someone please tell me what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.82,0:42:42.34,ENG,423,0,0,0,,Computer. Request security procedure
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.55,0:42:44.95,ENG,424,0,0,0,,and access to Project Genesis summary.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.59,0:42:48.18,ENG,425,0,0,0,,Identify for retina scan.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.36,0:42:50.69,ENG,426,0,0,0,,Kirk...Admiral James T.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.87,0:42:58.27,ENG,427,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.44,0:43:00.96,ENG,428,0,0,0,,Security Scan approved.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.14,0:43:02.30,ENG,429,0,0,0,,Summary, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.47,0:43:04.50,ENG,430,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.64,0:43:06.54,ENG,431,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.71,0:43:10.17,ENG,432,0,0,0,,Project Genesis. A proposal to the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.35,0:43:13.68,ENG,433,0,0,0,,- Carol Marcus. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.85,0:43:15.91,ENG,434,0,0,0,,What exactly is Genesis?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.02,0:43:21.79,ENG,435,0,0,0,,Well, put simply, Genesis is life from lifelessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.06,0:43:26.39,ENG,436,0,0,0,,It is a process whereby molecular structure is reorganised
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.57,0:43:31.73,ENG,437,0,0,0,,at the sub-atomic level into life-generating matter of equal mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.90,0:43:35.10,ENG,438,0,0,0,,Stage One of our experiments was conducted in the laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.27,0:43:39.40,ENG,439,0,0,0,,Stage Two will be attempted in a lifeless underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.58,0:43:43.74,ENG,440,0,0,0,,Stage Three will involve the process on a planetary scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.95,0:43:47.04,ENG,441,0,0,0,,It is our intention to introduce the Genesis device
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.25,0:43:53.05,ENG,442,0,0,0,,into a pre-selected area of a lifeless space body, such as a moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.23,0:43:56.22,ENG,443,0,0,0,,The device is delivered, instantaneously causing
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.39,0:43:59.16,ENG,444,0,0,0,,what we call the Genesis Effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.33,0:44:03.03,ENG,445,0,0,0,,Matter is reorganised with life-generating results.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.75,0:44:21.65,ENG,446,0,0,0,,Instead of a dead moon, a living, breathing planet
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.82,0:44:26.26,ENG,447,0,0,0,,capable of sustaining whatever life forms we deposit on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.86,0:44:27.92,ENG,448,0,0,0,,Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.09,0:44:33.43,ENG,449,0,0,0,,The moon simulated here represents a fraction of Genesis' potential,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.60,0:44:38.66,ENG,450,0,0,0,,should the Federation wish to fund the experiment to its conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.84,0:44:43.24,ENG,451,0,0,0,,When we consider the cosmic problems of population and food supply,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.41,0:44:46.24,ENG,452,0,0,0,,the usefulness of this process becomes clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.41,0:44:49.94,ENG,453,0,0,0,,This concludes our proposal. Thank you for your attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.72,0:44:53.48,ENG,454,0,0,0,,It literally is Genesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.62,0:44:56.95,ENG,455,0,0,0,,The power of creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.82,0:45:02.12,ENG,456,0,0,0,,- Have they proceeded? - The tape was made a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.29,0:45:05.99,ENG,457,0,0,0,,I can only assume they've reached Stage Two by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.16,0:45:10.33,ENG,458,0,0,0,,But, dear Lord, do you think we're intelligent enough to...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.50,0:45:15.27,ENG,459,0,0,0,,Suppose... What if this thing were used where life already exists?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.44,0:45:19.64,ENG,460,0,0,0,,It would destroy such life... in favour of its new matrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.18,0:45:25.14,ENG,461,0,0,0,,Its new matrix? Do you have any idea what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.35,0:45:29.31,ENG,462,0,0,0,,I was not attempting to evaluate its moral implications.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.52,0:45:34.58,ENG,463,0,0,0,,In cosmic history it has always been easier to destroy than to create.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.76,0:45:38.06,ENG,464,0,0,0,,Not any more! Now we can do both at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.23,0:45:41.22,ENG,465,0,0,0,,According to myth, Earth was created in six days.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.40,0:45:45.67,ENG,466,0,0,0,,Now watch out! Here comes Genesis! We'll do it for you in six minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.84,0:45:50.00,ENG,467,0,0,0,,Really, Dr McCoy, you must learn to govern your passions.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.18,0:45:53.58,ENG,468,0,0,0,,They will be your undoing. Logic suggests...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.75,0:45:57.55,ENG,469,0,0,0,,Logic?! My God, the man's talking about logic!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.75,0:45:59.98,ENG,470,0,0,0,,We're talking about universal Armageddon!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.09,0:46:04.32,ENG,471,0,0,0,,- You green-blooded, inhuman... - Bridge to Admiral Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.49,0:46:09.02,ENG,472,0,0,0,,Sensors indicate a vessel in our area, closing fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.19,0:46:14.43,ENG,473,0,0,0,,- What do you make of her? - It's one of ours. It's Reliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.57,0:46:19.83,ENG,474,0,0,0,,Try the emergency channels.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.51,0:46:25.70,ENG,475,0,0,0,,Picture, Mr Saavik.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.39,0:46:41.69,ENG,476,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.86,0:46:44.35,ENG,477,0,0,0,,Slow to one-half impulse power.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.10,0:46:50.09,ENG,478,0,0,0,,- Let's be friends. - Slowing to one-half impulse power.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.27,0:46:54.76,ENG,479,0,0,0,,Reliant in our section. This quadrant, sir. And slowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.94,0:46:59.24,ENG,480,0,0,0,,Sir? May l quote General Order 12? ''On the approach of any vessel,''
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.41,0:47:01.90,ENG,481,0,0,0,,''when communications have not been established...''
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.11,0:47:05.71,ENG,482,0,0,0,,The Admiral is well aware of the regulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.92,0:47:07.21,ENG,483,0,0,0,,Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.02,0:47:13.55,ENG,484,0,0,0,,Is it possible their Comm system has failed?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.59,0:47:16.32,ENG,485,0,0,0,,It would explain many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.49,0:47:19.73,ENG,486,0,0,0,,They're requesting communications, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.90,0:47:21.46,ENG,487,0,0,0,,Let them eat static!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.64,0:47:26.10,ENG,488,0,0,0,,They're still running with shields down.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.27,0:47:29.71,ENG,489,0,0,0,,Of course! We are one big happy fleet!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.78,0:47:37.54,ENG,490,0,0,0,,Ah, Kirk, my old friend! Do you know the Klingon proverb that tells us
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.75,0:47:42.05,ENG,491,0,0,0,,revenge is a dish that is best served cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.56,0:47:49.08,ENG,492,0,0,0,,It is very cold...in space.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.94,0:48:00.96,ENG,493,0,0,0,,This is damned peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.87,0:48:05.31,ENG,494,0,0,0,,- Yellow Alert! - Energise defence fields!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.05,0:48:16.99,ENG,495,0,0,0,,A voice. They say their Chambers coil is overloading their Comm system.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.12,0:48:21.52,ENG,496,0,0,0,,Scanning. Their coil emissions are normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.40,0:48:28.23,ENG,497,0,0,0,,- Their shields are still down. - Raise ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.67,0:48:33.66,ENG,498,0,0,0,,- Their shields are going up! - Lock phasers on target.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.97,0:48:36.57,ENG,499,0,0,0,,Locking phasers on target.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.74,0:48:38.68,ENG,500,0,0,0,,- They're locking phasers. - Raise shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.84,0:48:40.04,ENG,501,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.83,0:48:57.06,ENG,502,0,0,0,,- Sulu, get those shields up! - Trying, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.49,0:49:22.51,ENG,503,0,0,0,,I can't get power, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.49,0:49:26.25,ENG,504,0,0,0,,Scotty?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.42,0:49:29.22,ENG,505,0,0,0,,- Uhura, turn off those channels! - Mr Scott on the screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.39,0:49:34.30,ENG,506,0,0,0,,We're just hanging on, sir! The main energiser's out!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.47,0:49:37.76,ENG,507,0,0,0,,- Try auxiliary power! - Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.94,0:49:39.43,ENG,508,0,0,0,,Damage report.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.54,0:49:51.61,ENG,509,0,0,0,,- They knew exactly where to hit us. - Who knew where to hit us? And why?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.82,0:49:55.58,ENG,510,0,0,0,,One thing is certain. We cannot escape on auxiliary power.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.62,0:49:58.85,ENG,511,0,0,0,,Visual!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.59,0:50:03.79,ENG,512,0,0,0,,- Sulu, divert all power to phasers. - Too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.96,0:50:05.55,ENG,513,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.54,0:50:19.10,ENG,514,0,0,0,,Scotty! What's left?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.28,0:50:22.77,ENG,515,0,0,0,,Just the batteries! l can have auxiliary power in a few minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.98,0:50:25.42,ENG,516,0,0,0,,We don't have a few minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.22,0:50:34.19,ENG,517,0,0,0,,- Can you give me phaser power? - A few shots!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.36,0:50:36.83,ENG,518,0,0,0,,- Not enough against their shields. - Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.00,0:50:40.29,ENG,519,0,0,0,,Admiral! The commander of the Reliant is signalling!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.47,0:50:42.99,ENG,520,0,0,0,,He wishes to discuss terms of our surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.34,0:50:55.11,ENG,521,0,0,0,,Visual on screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.31,0:50:58.44,ENG,522,0,0,0,,Do it! While we still have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.96,0:51:06.18,ENG,523,0,0,0,,On screen, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.83,0:51:18.93,ENG,524,0,0,0,,- Khan! - You still remember, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.10,0:51:21.73,ENG,525,0,0,0,,I cannot help but be touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.91,0:51:24.37,ENG,526,0,0,0,,I, of course, remember you!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.54,0:51:28.71,ENG,527,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this attack?! Where is the crew of the Reliant?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.91,0:51:32.44,ENG,528,0,0,0,,Surely l have made my meaning plain.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.65,0:51:36.02,ENG,529,0,0,0,,I mean to avenge myself upon you, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.19,0:51:41.68,ENG,530,0,0,0,,I've deprived your ship of power and will deprive you of your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.03,0:51:48.23,ENG,531,0,0,0,,But l wanted you to know first who it was who had beaten you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.70,0:51:51.17,ENG,532,0,0,0,,Khan...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.17,0:51:55.77,ENG,533,0,0,0,,If it's me you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.94,0:51:59.71,ENG,534,0,0,0,,...l'll have myself beamed aboard. Spare my crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.88,0:52:05.14,ENG,535,0,0,0,,I make you a counter-proposal. l'll agree to your terms if...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.35,0:52:10.25,ENG,536,0,0,0,,...if...in addition to yourself, you hand over to me
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.42,0:52:15.76,ENG,537,0,0,0,,all data and material regarding the project called... Genesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.43,0:52:20.39,ENG,538,0,0,0,,- Genesis? What's that? - Don't insult my intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.00,0:52:23.76,ENG,539,0,0,0,,Give me some time to recall the data on our computers.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.44,0:52:27.50,ENG,540,0,0,0,,I give you 60 seconds, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.54,0:52:35.34,ENG,541,0,0,0,,Clear the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.49,0:52:43.82,ENG,542,0,0,0,,At least we know he doesn't have Genesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.99,0:52:47.01,ENG,543,0,0,0,,Keep nodding as though l'm still giving orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.19,0:52:50.56,ENG,544,0,0,0,,Mr Saavik, punch up the data charts of Reliant's command console.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.20,0:52:53.60,ENG,545,0,0,0,,- Hurry! - 45 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.77,0:52:55.60,ENG,546,0,0,0,,The prefix code?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.94,0:53:04.50,ENG,547,0,0,0,,- The chart's up, sir. - Admiral!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.64,0:53:06.23,ENG,548,0,0,0,,We're finding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.25,0:53:10.31,ENG,549,0,0,0,,- Admiral! - Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.52,0:53:14.92,ENG,550,0,0,0,,Please, give us time. The bridge is smashed, the computers inoperative.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.09,0:53:17.68,ENG,551,0,0,0,,Time is a luxury you don't have, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.23,0:53:26.46,ENG,552,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.73,0:53:30.79,ENG,553,0,0,0,,- Admiral? - It's coming through now, Khan.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.07,0:53:38.67,ENG,554,0,0,0,,Reliant's prefix number is 16309.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.84,0:53:40.28,ENG,555,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.44,0:53:43.38,ENG,556,0,0,0,,You have to learn why things work on a Starship.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.55,0:53:45.68,ENG,557,0,0,0,,Each ship has its own combination code.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.88,0:53:48.85,ENG,558,0,0,0,,To prevent an enemy from doing what we're attempting.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.22,0:53:54.82,ENG,559,0,0,0,,Using our console to order Reliant to lower her shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.99,0:53:58.22,ENG,560,0,0,0,,Assuming he hasn't changed the combination.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.40,0:54:00.56,ENG,561,0,0,0,,Fifteen seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.14,0:54:07.76,ENG,562,0,0,0,,Khan, how do we know you'll keep your word?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.94,0:54:11.03,ENG,563,0,0,0,,I've given you no word to keep, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.21,0:54:14.27,ENG,564,0,0,0,,In my judgment, you simply have no alternative.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.58,0:54:20.14,ENG,565,0,0,0,,I see your point.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.35,0:54:23.18,ENG,566,0,0,0,,Stand by to receive our transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.49,0:54:27.95,ENG,567,0,0,0,,Mr Sulu, lock phasers on target and await my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.36,0:54:33.09,ENG,568,0,0,0,,Time's up...Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.26,0:54:34.60,ENG,569,0,0,0,,Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.00,0:54:37.06,ENG,570,0,0,0,,Now, Mr Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.94,0:54:46.03,ENG,571,0,0,0,,Sir! Our shields are dropping!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.18,0:54:49.74,ENG,572,0,0,0,,Raise them!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.82,0:54:52.98,ENG,573,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.12,0:54:56.35,ENG,574,0,0,0,,Where's the override?!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.52,0:54:58.22,ENG,575,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.32,0:55:01.59,ENG,576,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.60,0:55:08.36,ENG,577,0,0,0,,Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.53,0:55:10.93,ENG,578,0,0,0,,- We can't fire! - Why can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.10,0:55:15.47,ENG,579,0,0,0,,They've damaged the photon control and the Warp Drive. We must withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.64,0:55:17.73,ENG,580,0,0,0,,- No! No! - Sir, we must!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.75,0:55:28.95,ENG,581,0,0,0,,The Enterprise can wait! She's not going anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.53,0:55:40.46,ENG,582,0,0,0,,- Sir, you did it! - l did nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.53,0:55:46.49,ENG,583,0,0,0,,Except get caught with my breeches down. l must be getting senile.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.67,0:55:50.90,ENG,584,0,0,0,,Mr Saavik? You go right on quoting regulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.08,0:55:54.07,ENG,585,0,0,0,,In the meantime, let's find out how badly we've been hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.86,0:56:46.30,ENG,586,0,0,0,,- ls the word given, Admiral? - The word is given.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.93,0:56:49.37,ENG,587,0,0,0,,Warp speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.84,0:56:52.93,ENG,588,0,0,0,,Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.05,0:57:10.99,ENG,589,0,0,0,,He stayed at his post... when the trainees ran!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.19,0:57:15.12,ENG,590,0,0,0,,- Admiral? This is Spock. - Yes, Spock?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.29,0:57:18.06,ENG,591,0,0,0,,Engine Room reports auxiliary power restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.23,0:57:21.32,ENG,592,0,0,0,,We can proceed at impulse power.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.50,0:57:23.93,ENG,593,0,0,0,,Best speed to Regula One. Kirk out.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.10,0:57:26.19,ENG,594,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Scotty.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.04,0:57:31.17,ENG,595,0,0,0,,Approaching Regula and Space Lab Regula One.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.34,0:57:36.14,ENG,596,0,0,0,,Space Station Regula One, this is the Starship Enterprise. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.65,0:57:42.31,ENG,597,0,0,0,,Space Station Regula One, do you read?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.26,0:57:49.25,ENG,598,0,0,0,,Space Station Regula One, this is Enterprise. Please acknowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.13,0:57:53.65,ENG,599,0,0,0,,This is Enterprise. Do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.27,0:58:00.00,ENG,600,0,0,0,,Space Station Regula One, do you read? Please come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.07,0:58:03.10,ENG,601,0,0,0,,There's no response, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.05,0:58:08.34,ENG,602,0,0,0,,Sensors, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.55,0:58:13.38,ENG,603,0,0,0,,Still inoperative. There's no way to ascertain what's inside the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.55,0:58:16.52,ENG,604,0,0,0,,No way of telling if Reliant is still in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.36,0:58:19.65,ENG,605,0,0,0,,What do you make of that planetoid beyond?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.82,0:58:22.52,ENG,606,0,0,0,,Regula is class 'D'. lt consists
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.63,0:58:28.50,ENG,607,0,0,0,,of various unremarkable ores. Essentially a great rock in space.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.67,0:58:32.66,ENG,608,0,0,0,,- Reliant could be behind the rock. - A distinct possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.71,0:58:36.51,ENG,609,0,0,0,,- Engineering? - Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.68,0:58:39.87,ENG,610,0,0,0,,Mr Scott? Do you have enough power for transporters?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.91,0:58:42.61,ENG,611,0,0,0,,Barely, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.22,0:58:47.55,ENG,612,0,0,0,,- l'm going down there. - Khan could be there!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.72,0:58:51.16,ENG,613,0,0,0,,He's been there, hasn't found what he wants. Who can you spare?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.33,0:58:52.69,ENG,614,0,0,0,,I can spare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.86,0:58:56.96,ENG,615,0,0,0,,Begging your pardon. General Order 15: "No flag officer shall beam"
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.13,0:58:59.73,ENG,616,0,0,0,,''into a hazardous area without armed escort.''
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.90,0:59:01.39,ENG,617,0,0,0,,There's no such regulation!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.44,0:59:08.93,ENG,618,0,0,0,,All right, join the party. Mr Spock, the ship is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.11,0:59:11.01,ENG,619,0,0,0,,Jim, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.11,0:59:13.14,ENG,620,0,0,0,,We will!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.17,0:59:39.54,ENG,621,0,0,0,,Indeterminate life signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.81,0:59:45.01,ENG,622,0,0,0,,Phasers on stun.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.18,0:59:49.65,ENG,623,0,0,0,,Move out.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.25,1:00:56.58,ENG,624,0,0,0,,Jim!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.56,1:01:10.22,ENG,625,0,0,0,,Rigor hasn't set in. This couldn't have happened too long ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.27,1:01:12.32,ENG,626,0,0,0,,Carol...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.50,1:01:16.46,ENG,627,0,0,0,,Enterprise calling Space Lab Regula One. Respond, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.07,1:01:19.60,ENG,628,0,0,0,,Admiral! Over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.77,1:01:22.26,ENG,629,0,0,0,,Dr Marcus, come in, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.80,1:01:48.06,ENG,630,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.24,1:01:50.60,ENG,631,0,0,0,,Please acknowledge signal! Please...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.77,1:01:56.61,ENG,632,0,0,0,,This is Lieutenant Saavik. We're all right. Please stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.05,1:02:01.88,ENG,633,0,0,0,,Oh, sir! lt was Khan!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.05,1:02:04.85,ENG,634,0,0,0,,- We found him on Ceti Alpha Five. - Easy...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.45,1:02:10.98,ENG,635,0,0,0,,He...put...creatures in our bodies!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.19,1:02:13.39,ENG,636,0,0,0,,To control our minds!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.63,1:02:16.82,ENG,637,0,0,0,,It's all right. You're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.00,1:02:20.09,ENG,638,0,0,0,,Made us say lies...do things.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.13,1:02:26.66,ENG,639,0,0,0,,But we beat him. He thought he controlled us, but he did not!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.84,1:02:29.60,ENG,640,0,0,0,,- The Captain was strong. - Captain...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.64,1:02:35.34,ENG,641,0,0,0,,Where's Dr Marcus? Where are the Genesis materials?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.55,1:02:39.28,ENG,642,0,0,0,,He couldn't find them. Even the data banks were empty.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.49,1:02:43.89,ENG,643,0,0,0,,- Erased? - He tortured those people.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.06,1:02:47.93,ENG,644,0,0,0,,But none of them would tell him anything. He went wild.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.10,1:02:54.19,ENG,645,0,0,0,,He slit their throats. He wanted to tear the place apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.37,1:02:59.53,ENG,646,0,0,0,,But he was late. He had to get back to Reliant to blow you to bits!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.71,1:03:02.17,ENG,647,0,0,0,,Where's Reliant's crew? Dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.04,1:03:07.21,ENG,648,0,0,0,,Marooned on Ceti Alpha Five.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.38,1:03:11.08,ENG,649,0,0,0,,He's mad. He blames you for the death of his wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.29,1:03:13.75,ENG,650,0,0,0,,I know what he blames me for.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.69,1:03:23.65,ENG,651,0,0,0,,The escape pods are all in place. Where's the Transporter Room?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.20,1:03:28.46,ENG,652,0,0,0,,- Did he make it down here? - lt was not my impression.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.64,1:03:32.30,ENG,653,0,0,0,,He spent most of the time trying to wring information out of the people.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.84,1:03:38.61,ENG,654,0,0,0,,The unit's been left on. This means nobody remained to turn it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.78,1:03:43.24,ENG,655,0,0,0,,Those people bought escape time for Genesis with their lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.45,1:03:48.15,ENG,656,0,0,0,,This is not logical. These coordinates are deep inside Regula.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.32,1:03:50.31,ENG,657,0,0,0,,A planetoid we know to be lifeless.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.53,1:03:56.76,ENG,658,0,0,0,,If Stage Two was completed, it was going to be underground.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.93,1:04:00.92,ENG,659,0,0,0,,- Underground, she said! - Stage Two of what?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.64,1:04:04.93,ENG,660,0,0,0,,- Kirk to Enterprise. - Spock here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.11,1:04:07.07,ENG,661,0,0,0,,Captain Spock, damage report.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.24,1:04:13.61,ENG,662,0,0,0,,If we go by the book, like Saavik, hours could seem like days.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.98,1:04:18.42,ENG,663,0,0,0,,- Let's have it, Captain. - The situation is grave.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.59,1:04:21.18,ENG,664,0,0,0,,We won't have main power for six days.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.39,1:04:24.19,ENG,665,0,0,0,,Auxiliary power has temporarily failed.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.36,1:04:29.76,ENG,666,0,0,0,,Restoration may be possible in two days...by the book, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.93,1:04:31.90,ENG,667,0,0,0,,You can't even beam us back?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.07,1:04:34.06,ENG,668,0,0,0,,Not at present.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.30,1:04:40.00,ENG,669,0,0,0,,Captain Spock. If you don't hear from us within one hour,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.17,1:04:42.47,ENG,670,0,0,0,,your orders are to restore what power you can,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.21,1:04:45.74,ENG,671,0,0,0,,take the Enterprise to the nearest Starbase
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.91,1:04:48.47,ENG,672,0,0,0,,and alert Starfleet Command when out of jamming range.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.65,1:04:50.91,ENG,673,0,0,0,,Sir, we won't leave you behind!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.12,1:04:55.21,ENG,674,0,0,0,,Uhura, if you don't hear from us, there won't be anybody behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.89,1:04:59.62,ENG,675,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, you can stay here, or...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.79,1:05:03.70,ENG,676,0,0,0,,If it's all the same, Admiral, we'd like to share the risk.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.73,1:05:07.33,ENG,677,0,0,0,,Right. Let's go. Saavik.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.00,1:05:12.10,ENG,678,0,0,0,,- Go? Where are we going? - Where they went.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.51,1:05:16.77,ENG,679,0,0,0,,Suppose they went nowhere?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.94,1:05:19.88,ENG,680,0,0,0,,Then this will be your big chance to get away from it all.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.74,1:05:51.11,ENG,681,0,0,0,,Admiral...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.33,1:06:07.45,ENG,682,0,0,0,,Genesis, l presume.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.10,1:06:16.73,ENG,683,0,0,0,,Phasers down!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.07,1:06:19.33,ENG,684,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.61,1:06:30.01,ENG,685,0,0,0,,- Where's Dr Marcus? - l'm Dr Marcus!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.22,1:06:31.78,ENG,686,0,0,0,,Jim!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.83,1:06:46.20,ENG,687,0,0,0,,Is that David?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.37,1:06:49.67,ENG,688,0,0,0,,Mother! He killed everybody we left behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.14,1:06:56.04,ENG,689,0,0,0,,Of course he didn't. David, you're just making this harder.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.21,1:06:59.91,ENG,690,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's even harder than you think, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.08,1:07:02.98,ENG,691,0,0,0,,Please don't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.48,1:07:04.75,ENG,692,0,0,0,,Chekov!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.95,1:07:08.35,ENG,693,0,0,0,,I'm...sorry, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.62,1:07:12.46,ENG,694,0,0,0,,Your Excellency, have you been listening?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.76,1:07:19.89,ENG,695,0,0,0,,I have indeed, Captain. You have done well.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.07,1:07:23.16,ENG,696,0,0,0,,I knew it! You son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.80,1:07:29.30,ENG,697,0,0,0,,- Don't move! Anybody! - Captain? We are waiting.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.34,1:07:33.31,ENG,698,0,0,0,,- What's the delay? - All is well, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.48,1:07:35.64,ENG,699,0,0,0,,You have the coordinates to beam up Genesis.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.85,1:07:40.58,ENG,700,0,0,0,,First things first, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.99,1:07:45.65,ENG,701,0,0,0,,Kill Admiral Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.30,1:07:58.86,ENG,702,0,0,0,,Sir, that is difficult. l...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.04,1:08:02.53,ENG,703,0,0,0,,- I try to obey, but... - Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.08,1:08:04.24,ENG,704,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.39,1:08:14.65,ENG,705,0,0,0,,Kill him, Terrell, now!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.74,1:08:39.11,ENG,706,0,0,0,,God's sakes!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.18,1:08:42.98,ENG,707,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.27,1:09:04.57,ENG,708,0,0,0,,Khan, you bloodsucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.47,1:09:09.27,ENG,709,0,0,0,,You're gonna have to do your own dirty work now! Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.11,1:09:13.70,ENG,710,0,0,0,,Kirk!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.02,1:09:19.47,ENG,711,0,0,0,,Kirk, you're still alive, my old friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.69,1:09:26.52,ENG,712,0,0,0,,Still, ''old friend''! You've managed to kill just about everyone else,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.69,1:09:30.93,ENG,713,0,0,0,,but like a poor marksman, you keep missing the target.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.11,1:09:43.20,ENG,714,0,0,0,,Perhaps l no longer need to try, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.52,1:09:51.81,ENG,715,0,0,0,,He can't take it!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.32,1:09:56.52,ENG,716,0,0,0,,Khan!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.53,1:10:04.36,ENG,717,0,0,0,,You've got Genesis, but you don't have me!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.53,1:10:09.83,ENG,718,0,0,0,,You were going to kill me, Khan! You're going to have to come here!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.87,1:10:13.81,ENG,719,0,0,0,,I've done far worse than kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.44,1:10:17.77,ENG,720,0,0,0,,I've hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.25,1:10:22.94,ENG,721,0,0,0,,And l wish to go on...hurting you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.95,1:10:28.22,ENG,722,0,0,0,,I shall leave you as you left me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.92,1:10:30.58,ENG,723,0,0,0,,As you left her.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.76,1:10:36.22,ENG,724,0,0,0,,Marooned for all eternity, in the centre of a dead planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.76,1:10:39.60,ENG,725,0,0,0,,Buried alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.97,1:10:41.80,ENG,726,0,0,0,,Buried alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.07,1:10:44.66,ENG,727,0,0,0,,Khan!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.07,1:10:47.60,ENG,728,0,0,0,,Khan!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.91,1:10:57.87,ENG,729,0,0,0,,This is Lieutenant Saavik calling Enterprise. Can you read us?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.99,1:11:04.65,ENG,730,0,0,0,,- He's coming around. - Pavel?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.59,1:11:11.66,ENG,731,0,0,0,,It's no use, Admiral. They're still jamming all channels.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.83,1:11:14.46,ENG,732,0,0,0,,If Enterprise followed orders, she's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.63,1:11:17.69,ENG,733,0,0,0,,If she couldn't obey, she's finished.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.24,1:11:20.50,ENG,734,0,0,0,,So are we, it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.88,1:11:25.14,ENG,735,0,0,0,,I don't understand! Who's responsible for all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.21,1:11:27.44,ENG,736,0,0,0,,Who is Khan?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.61,1:11:31.57,ENG,737,0,0,0,,- It's a long story. - We appear to have plenty of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.16,1:11:40.39,ENG,738,0,0,0,,Is there anything to eat? l don't know about you, but l'm starved.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.56,1:11:43.03,ENG,739,0,0,0,,How can you think of food now?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.20,1:11:46.03,ENG,740,0,0,0,,First order of business. Survival.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.20,1:11:49.13,ENG,741,0,0,0,,There is food in the Genesis cave.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.30,1:11:53.86,ENG,742,0,0,0,,Enough to last a lifetime... if necessary.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.94,1:11:56.47,ENG,743,0,0,0,,We thought this was Genesis.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.91,1:12:03.04,ENG,744,0,0,0,,It took the Starfleet Corps of Engineers
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.25,1:12:05.81,ENG,745,0,0,0,,ten months in spacesuits to tunnel out all this.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.52,1:12:11.51,ENG,746,0,0,0,,What we did in there, we did in a day.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.72,1:12:16.66,ENG,747,0,0,0,,David, why don't you show Dr McCoy and the Lieutenant our idea of food?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.83,1:12:21.86,ENG,748,0,0,0,,- We can't just sit here! - Oh, yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.04,1:12:23.97,ENG,749,0,0,0,,This is just to give us something to do, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.97,1:12:29.31,ENG,750,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.92,1:12:40.98,ENG,751,0,0,0,,- Admiral? - As your teacher, Mr Spock, says,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.19,1:12:45.32,ENG,752,0,0,0,,''l like to think that there always are...possibilities.''
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.74,1:13:00.21,ENG,753,0,0,0,,I did what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.37,1:13:02.03,ENG,754,0,0,0,,I stayed away.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.38,1:13:06.35,ENG,755,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.38,1:13:09.25,ENG,756,0,0,0,,How can you ask me that?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.48,1:13:12.85,ENG,757,0,0,0,,Were we together?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.02,1:13:15.32,ENG,758,0,0,0,,Were we going to be?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.49,1:13:18.42,ENG,759,0,0,0,,You had your world and l had mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.76,1:13:21.99,ENG,760,0,0,0,,And l wanted him in mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.16,1:13:25.53,ENG,761,0,0,0,,Not chasing through the universe with his father!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.84,1:13:39.47,ENG,762,0,0,0,,Actually...he's a lot like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.28,1:13:43.15,ENG,763,0,0,0,,In many ways.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.39,1:13:48.79,ENG,764,0,0,0,,Please tell me what you're feeling.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.33,1:13:55.42,ENG,765,0,0,0,,There's a man out there l haven't seen in 15 years,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.60,1:13:57.69,ENG,766,0,0,0,,who's trying to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.90,1:14:02.77,ENG,767,0,0,0,,You show me a son that'd be happy to help him.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.11,1:14:07.60,ENG,768,0,0,0,,My son...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.64,1:14:13.77,ENG,769,0,0,0,,My life that could have been...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.25,1:14:16.72,ENG,770,0,0,0,,...and wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.49,1:14:21.61,ENG,771,0,0,0,,And what am l feeling?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.33,1:14:26.69,ENG,772,0,0,0,,Old.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.16,1:14:32.15,ENG,773,0,0,0,,Worn out.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.34,1:14:40.67,ENG,774,0,0,0,,Let me show you something...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.91,1:14:46.68,ENG,775,0,0,0,,...that'll make you feel young, as when the world was new.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.36,1:15:03.23,ENG,776,0,0,0,,Impulse power restored.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.40,1:15:08.36,ENG,777,0,0,0,,Excellent. More than a match for poor Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.42,1:15:32.29,ENG,778,0,0,0,,You did all this in a day?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.46,1:15:35.05,ENG,779,0,0,0,,The matrix formed in a day.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.23,1:15:40.33,ENG,780,0,0,0,,The life forms grew later, at a substantially accelerated rate.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.80,1:15:48.97,ENG,781,0,0,0,,Jim! This is fantastic! Have you ever seen the like?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.08,1:15:53.34,ENG,782,0,0,0,,Can l cook or can't l?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.30,1:16:13.73,ENG,783,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.97,1:16:22.07,ENG,784,0,0,0,,Sir? May l ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.24,1:16:25.54,ENG,785,0,0,0,,- What's on your mind, Lieutenant? - The Kobayashi Maru.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.71,1:16:28.04,ENG,786,0,0,0,,Are you asking if this is that scenario?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.21,1:16:34.55,ENG,787,0,0,0,,On the test, will you tell me what you did? l would really like to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.72,1:16:38.92,ENG,788,0,0,0,,Lieutenant, you are looking at the only Starfleet cadet
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.09,1:16:41.96,ENG,789,0,0,0,,who ever beat the no-win scenario.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.13,1:16:44.22,ENG,790,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.40,1:16:48.46,ENG,791,0,0,0,,I reprogrammed the simulation so it was possible to rescue the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.63,1:16:50.76,ENG,792,0,0,0,,- What? - He cheated!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.94,1:16:53.57,ENG,793,0,0,0,,I changed the conditions of the test.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.74,1:16:58.68,ENG,794,0,0,0,,I got a commendation for original thinking. l don't like to lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.85,1:17:02.84,ENG,795,0,0,0,,Then you never faced that situation...faced death?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.42,1:17:06.08,ENG,796,0,0,0,,I don't believe in a no-win scenario.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.12,1:17:12.25,ENG,797,0,0,0,,- Spock. It's two hours. Ready? - Right on schedule.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.43,1:17:16.36,ENG,798,0,0,0,,Just give us your coordinates and we'll beam you aboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.43,1:17:22.23,ENG,799,0,0,0,,I don't like to lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.90,1:17:26.39,ENG,800,0,0,0,,But we were immobilised. Captain Spock said it'd be two days.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.57,1:17:30.06,ENG,801,0,0,0,,Lieutenant, you of all people go by the book. Spock!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.24,1:17:32.51,ENG,802,0,0,0,,- You know Dr Marcus. - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.68,1:17:34.98,ENG,803,0,0,0,,- l'm taking this bunch to Sick Bay. - By the book?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.15,1:17:40.61,ENG,804,0,0,0,,Regulation 46A. ''If transmissions are monitored during battle...''
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.82,1:17:43.38,ENG,805,0,0,0,,''...no uncoded messages on an open channel''.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.79,1:17:49.79,ENG,806,0,0,0,,- You lied. - l exaggerated.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.96,1:17:53.90,ENG,807,0,0,0,,Hours instead of days. Now we have minutes instead of hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.94,1:18:01.46,ENG,808,0,0,0,,- lnoperative below C-Deck. - What is working?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.64,1:18:05.13,ENG,809,0,0,0,,We have partial main power. Best we could do in two hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.87,1:18:27.63,ENG,810,0,0,0,,- Admiral on the bridge. - Battle stations!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.67,1:18:31.93,ENG,811,0,0,0,,Tactical!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.04,1:18:40.51,ENG,812,0,0,0,,She can still outrun us... and outgun us.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.48,1:18:46.14,ENG,813,0,0,0,,- But there is the Mutara Nebula. - Scotty, can we make it inside?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.35,1:18:50.19,ENG,814,0,0,0,,The energiser's bypassed, so don't give me too many bumps.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.36,1:18:53.99,ENG,815,0,0,0,,- No promises. On your way. - Trouble with the nebula
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.16,1:18:57.79,ENG,816,0,0,0,,is all that static discharge and gas clouds our tactical display.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.96,1:19:00.93,ENG,817,0,0,0,,Visual won't function and shields will be useless.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.17,1:19:04.64,ENG,818,0,0,0,,Sauce for the goose, Mr Saavik.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.27,1:19:07.86,ENG,819,0,0,0,,The odds will be even.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.19,1:19:56.31,ENG,820,0,0,0,,There she is!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.52,1:19:58.29,ENG,821,0,0,0,,There she is!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.26,1:20:04.99,ENG,822,0,0,0,,Not so wounded as we were led to believe.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.16,1:20:06.72,ENG,823,0,0,0,,So much the better.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.92,1:20:36.45,ENG,824,0,0,0,,Estimating nebula penetration in 2.2 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.10,1:20:40.07,ENG,825,0,0,0,,Reliant is closing.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.61,1:20:51.13,ENG,826,0,0,0,,If they go in there, we'll lose them.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.71,1:20:54.18,ENG,827,0,0,0,,Explain it to them.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.76,1:21:08.69,ENG,828,0,0,0,,- That was close. - They don't want us going in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.57,1:21:18.16,ENG,829,0,0,0,,One minute to nebula perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.77,1:21:20.50,ENG,830,0,0,0,,Why are we slowing?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.64,1:21:26.13,ENG,831,0,0,0,,We daren't follow them into the nebula. Our shields would be useless.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.98,1:21:33.28,ENG,832,0,0,0,,- They are reducing speed. - Uhura, patch me in.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.22,1:21:37.69,ENG,833,0,0,0,,You're on, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.86,1:21:42.73,ENG,834,0,0,0,,Admiral Kirk here. We tried it your way, Khan. Game for a rematch?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.83,1:21:47.82,ENG,835,0,0,0,,Khan! l'm laughing
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.00,1:21:50.43,ENG,836,0,0,0,,at the ''superior intellect''.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.94,1:21:55.87,ENG,837,0,0,0,,- Full impulse power. - No, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.04,1:21:58.81,ENG,838,0,0,0,,You have Genesis. You can have whatever...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.98,1:22:01.64,ENG,839,0,0,0,,Full power! Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.75,1:22:09.88,ENG,840,0,0,0,,I'll say this for him, he's consistent.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.62,1:22:14.46,ENG,841,0,0,0,,We are now entering the Mutara Nebula.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.47,1:22:25.20,ENG,842,0,0,0,,Emergency lights.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.20,1:22:56.67,ENG,843,0,0,0,,Tactical.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.37,1:23:00.03,ENG,844,0,0,0,,Inoperative.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.04,1:23:05.53,ENG,845,0,0,0,,Raise the shields.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.71,1:23:10.17,ENG,846,0,0,0,,As l feared, sir, not functional. l'm reducing speed.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.73,1:23:54.16,ENG,847,0,0,0,,Target, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.33,1:23:57.78,ENG,848,0,0,0,,- Phaser lock inoperative. - Best guess, Sulu. Fire when ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.17,1:24:09.04,ENG,849,0,0,0,,Aft torpedoes! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.78,1:24:19.75,ENG,850,0,0,0,,Hold your course.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.47,1:24:44.91,ENG,851,0,0,0,,Evasive starboard!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.35,1:24:55.98,ENG,852,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.48,1:25:19.14,ENG,853,0,0,0,,Damage, Mr Scott?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.95,1:25:24.71,ENG,854,0,0,0,,Admiral, l've got to take the mains off the line.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.92,1:25:28.22,ENG,855,0,0,0,,- The radiation... - Scotty?!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.79,1:25:29.98,ENG,856,0,0,0,,Joachim!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.79,1:25:36.73,ENG,857,0,0,0,,Yours...is the...superior...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.04,1:25:46.23,ENG,858,0,0,0,,I shall avenge you!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.68,1:25:59.41,ENG,859,0,0,0,,Could you use another hand, Admiral?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.42,1:26:02.58,ENG,860,0,0,0,,Man the weapons console, Mr Chekov.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.99,1:26:09.72,ENG,861,0,0,0,,- Spock. - Sporadic energy readings.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.90,1:26:13.30,ENG,862,0,0,0,,Port side, aft. Could be an impulse turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.60,1:26:16.97,ENG,863,0,0,0,,He won't break off now.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.10,1:26:20.83,ENG,864,0,0,0,,He followed me this far, he'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.71,1:26:25.14,ENG,865,0,0,0,,But from where?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.31,1:26:28.77,ENG,866,0,0,0,,He's intelligent, but not experienced.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.95,1:26:32.88,ENG,867,0,0,0,,His pattern indicates two-dimensional thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.96,1:26:41.52,ENG,868,0,0,0,,- Full stop. - Full stop, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.36,1:26:45.73,ENG,869,0,0,0,,Z-minus 10,000 metres. Stand by photon torpedoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.82,1:27:41.01,ENG,870,0,0,0,,Torpedoes ready, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.46,1:27:53.69,ENG,871,0,0,0,,Look sharp.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.57,1:27:58.97,ENG,872,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.48,1:28:07.10,ENG,873,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.81,1:28:45.44,ENG,874,0,0,0,,Uhura, send to Commander, Reliant Prepare to be boarded
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.65,1:28:46.88,ENG,875,0,0,0,,Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.35,1:28:50.65,ENG,876,0,0,0,,Commander, Reliant, this is Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.29,1:28:54.42,ENG,877,0,0,0,,Surrender and prepare to be boarded.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.59,1:28:59.22,ENG,878,0,0,0,,Enterprise to Reliant. You are ordered to surrender your vessel.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.78,1:29:16.34,ENG,879,0,0,0,,Reliant! Come in, Reliant. You are ordered to surrender your vessel.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.52,1:29:21.08,ENG,880,0,0,0,,Enterprise to Reliant. You're ordered to surrender your vessel. Respond.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.40,1:29:37.63,ENG,881,0,0,0,,No, Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.24,1:29:42.07,ENG,882,0,0,0,,The game's not over.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.71,1:30:21.65,ENG,883,0,0,0,,To the last... l will grapple with thee!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.99,1:30:40.19,ENG,884,0,0,0,,Admiral? Scanning an energy source on Reliant.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.27,1:30:43.36,ENG,885,0,0,0,,A pattern l've never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.21,1:30:51.40,ENG,886,0,0,0,,- It's the Genesis Wave! - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.58,1:30:54.05,ENG,887,0,0,0,,They're on a build-up to detonation!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.45,1:30:58.44,ENG,888,0,0,0,,- How soon? - We encoded four minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.62,1:31:01.25,ENG,889,0,0,0,,- We'll beam aboard and stop it. - You can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.29,1:31:08.73,ENG,890,0,0,0,,Scotty! l need Warp Speed in three minutes, or we're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.16,1:31:12.53,ENG,891,0,0,0,,- No response, Admiral. - Scotty!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.70,1:31:16.00,ENG,892,0,0,0,,Mr Sulu, get us out of here. Best possible speed.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.21,1:31:59.64,ENG,893,0,0,0,,Are you out of your Vulcan mind?! No human can tolerate that radiation!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.81,1:32:03.34,ENG,894,0,0,0,,As you are so fond of observing, Doctor, l am not human.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.82,1:32:09.22,ENG,895,0,0,0,,- You're not going in there! - Perhaps you're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.39,1:32:14.62,ENG,896,0,0,0,,- What is Mr Scott's condition? - Well, l don't think that he...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.56,1:32:18.79,ENG,897,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Doctor, l have no time to discuss this logically.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.27,1:32:24.57,ENG,898,0,0,0,,Remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.60,1:32:27.30,ENG,899,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.45,1:32:38.38,ENG,900,0,0,0,,Spock! Get out of there! Spock!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.85,1:32:40.51,ENG,901,0,0,0,,Spock! Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.90,1:32:55.16,ENG,902,0,0,0,,- Time from my mark? - Two minutes ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.33,1:32:58.10,ENG,903,0,0,0,,Engine Room! What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.27,1:33:03.23,ENG,904,0,0,0,,- Spock! - Good God! Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.41,1:33:07.24,ENG,905,0,0,0,,No! God, don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.14,1:33:38.17,ENG,906,0,0,0,,Time?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.41,1:33:42.24,ENG,907,0,0,0,,Three minutes, 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.02,1:33:51.72,ENG,908,0,0,0,,- Distance from Reliant? - 4,000 kilometres.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.89,1:33:53.36,ENG,909,0,0,0,,We're not going to make it, are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.37,1:34:07.67,ENG,910,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.44,1:34:11.71,ENG,911,0,0,0,,No! You can't get away!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.35,1:34:18.44,ENG,912,0,0,0,,From hell's heart, l stab at thee!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.39,1:34:27.62,ENG,913,0,0,0,,For hate's sake, l spit my last breath...at thee!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.34,1:34:43.93,ENG,914,0,0,0,,- Sir! The mains are back on line! - Bless you, Scotty. Go, Sulu!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.02,1:35:30.04,ENG,915,0,0,0,,My God, Carol. Look at it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.17,1:35:46.13,ENG,916,0,0,0,,Engine Room? Well done, Scotty.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.24,1:35:51.11,ENG,917,0,0,0,,Jim! l think you'd better get down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.28,1:35:55.91,ENG,918,0,0,0,,- Bones? - Better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.42,1:36:01.61,ENG,919,0,0,0,,Saavik, take the con.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.65,1:36:31.95,ENG,920,0,0,0,,No! You'll flood the whole compartment!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.15,1:36:35.81,ENG,921,0,0,0,,- He'll die! - Sir! He's dead already.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.66,1:36:41.52,ENG,922,0,0,0,,It's too late, Jim.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.82,1:37:04.91,ENG,923,0,0,0,,Spock!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.68,1:37:39.88,ENG,924,0,0,0,,Ship...out of danger?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.52,1:37:42.75,ENG,925,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.32,1:37:48.72,ENG,926,0,0,0,,Don't grieve, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.20,1:37:52.89,ENG,927,0,0,0,,It is logical.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.30,1:37:59.60,ENG,928,0,0,0,,The needs of the many...outweigh...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.87,1:38:03.97,ENG,929,0,0,0,,...the needs of the few.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.01,1:38:06.74,ENG,930,0,0,0,,Or the one.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.19,1:38:19.52,ENG,931,0,0,0,,I never took... the Kobayashi Maru test.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.13,1:38:22.82,ENG,932,0,0,0,,Until now.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.70,1:38:27.69,ENG,933,0,0,0,,What do you think of my solution?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.00,1:38:31.70,ENG,934,0,0,0,,Spock!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.88,1:38:44.61,ENG,935,0,0,0,,I have been...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.82,1:38:47.28,ENG,936,0,0,0,,...and always shall be...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.49,1:38:49.25,ENG,937,0,0,0,,...your friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.03,1:38:58.89,ENG,938,0,0,0,,Live long...and prosper!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.19,1:39:22.41,ENG,939,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.51,1:39:48.04,ENG,940,0,0,0,,We are assembled here today to pay final respects to our honoured dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.69,1:39:58.62,ENG,941,0,0,0,,And yet it should be noted that, in the midst of our sorrow,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.82,1:40:01.79,ENG,942,0,0,0,,this death takes place in the shadow of new life.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.96,1:40:04.45,ENG,943,0,0,0,,The sunrise of a new world.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.63,1:40:08.53,ENG,944,0,0,0,,A world that our beloved comrade gave his life to protect and nourish.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.07,1:40:13.47,ENG,945,0,0,0,,He did not feel his sacrifice a vain or empty one.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.21,1:40:17.54,ENG,946,0,0,0,,And we will not debate his profound wisdom at these proceedings.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.91,1:40:23.31,ENG,947,0,0,0,,Of my friend, l can only say this...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.62,1:40:31.92,ENG,948,0,0,0,,Of all the souls l have encountered in my travels...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.96,1:40:34.62,ENG,949,0,0,0,,...his was the most...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.40,1:40:40.02,ENG,950,0,0,0,,...human.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.37,1:40:43.60,ENG,951,0,0,0,,Honours...hup!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.05,1:42:09.45,ENG,952,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.56,1:42:14.49,ENG,953,0,0,0,,I don't mean to intrude.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.66,1:42:19.43,ENG,954,0,0,0,,No, not at all. l should be on the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.33,1:42:25.43,ENG,955,0,0,0,,- Can l talk to you for a minute? - Would you like a drink?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.60,1:42:28.27,ENG,956,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Saavik was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.94,1:42:32.38,ENG,957,0,0,0,,You never have faced a death.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.35,1:42:43.22,ENG,958,0,0,0,,No, not like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.96,1:42:48.05,ENG,959,0,0,0,,I haven't faced death.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.23,1:42:50.13,ENG,960,0,0,0,,I've cheated death.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.06,1:42:55.43,ENG,961,0,0,0,,I've tricked my way out of death...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.60,1:42:58.76,ENG,962,0,0,0,,...and patted myself on the back for my ingenuity.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.74,1:43:05.64,ENG,963,0,0,0,,- l know nothing. - You knew enough to tell Saavik
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.81,1:43:09.08,ENG,964,0,0,0,,that how we face death is at least as important as how we face life.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.72,1:43:14.71,ENG,965,0,0,0,,- Just words. - But good words.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.22,1:43:20.99,ENG,966,0,0,0,,That's where ideas begin. Maybe you should listen to them.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.70,1:43:28.00,ENG,967,0,0,0,,I was wrong about you. And l'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.07,1:43:33.47,ENG,968,0,0,0,,Is that what you came here to say?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.47,1:43:36.77,ENG,969,0,0,0,,Mainly.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.15,1:43:47.38,ENG,970,0,0,0,,And also that l'm...proud...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.72,1:43:53.16,ENG,971,0,0,0,,...very proud...to be your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.89,1:44:27.95,ENG,972,0,0,0,,Captain's Log, Stardate 8141.6. Starship Enterprise departing
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.13,1:44:31.69,ENG,973,0,0,0,,for Ceti Alpha Five to pick up the crew of USS Reliant.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.10,1:44:35.12,ENG,974,0,0,0,,All is well.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.30,1:44:38.70,ENG,975,0,0,0,,And yet, l can't help wondering about the friend l leave behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.87,1:44:43.60,ENG,976,0,0,0,,''There are always possibilities, '' Spock said.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.48,1:44:48.43,ENG,977,0,0,0,,And if Genesis is indeed ''life from death'',
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.01,1:44:52.78,ENG,978,0,0,0,,I must return to this place again.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.36,1:45:02.42,ENG,979,0,0,0,,He's really not dead. As long as we remember him.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.77,1:45:13.00,ENG,980,0,0,0,,''It's a far, far better thing l do than l have ever done before.''
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.71,1:45:19.14,ENG,981,0,0,0,,''A far better resting place...''
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.31,1:45:22.61,ENG,982,0,0,0,,''that l go to than l've ever known.''
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.35,1:45:25.21,ENG,983,0,0,0,,Is that a poem?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.39,1:45:30.35,ENG,984,0,0,0,,Something Spock was trying to tell me. On my birthday.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.76,1:45:35.35,ENG,985,0,0,0,,You OK, Jim? How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.50,1:45:39.59,ENG,986,0,0,0,,Young.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.04,1:45:46.60,ENG,987,0,0,0,,I feel young.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.34,1:47:01.40,ENG,988,0,0,0,,Space, the final frontier.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.48,1:47:08.21,ENG,989,0,0,0,,These are the continuing voyages of the Starship Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.55,1:47:15.98,ENG,990,0,0,0,,Her ongoing mission... to explore strange new worlds.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.16,1:47:20.89,ENG,991,0,0,0,,To seek out new life forms and new civilisations.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.27,1:47:27.21,ENG,992,0,0,0,,To boldly go... where no man has gone before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:54.50,CHS,1,0,0,0,,《星际迷航2：可汗之怒》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.27,0:02:56.76,CHS,2,0,0,0,,（23世纪）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.84,0:03:05.37,CHS,3,0,0,0,,航行日志， 星际日期8130.3
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:08.57,CHS,4,0,0,0,,企业号进行训练任务， 往GH星
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.78,0:03:14.48,CHS,5,0,0,0,,14段， 座标为22-87-4
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.66,0:03:19.62,CHS,6,0,0,0,,接近中立地带， 所有系统正常
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.79,0:03:23.42,CHS,7,0,0,0,,离开14段， 前往15段
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.60,0:03:28.33,CHS,8,0,0,0,,改行抛物线轨道， 避开中立地带
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.01,0:03:32.50,CHS,9,0,0,0,,轨道已改变
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.67,0:03:35.44,CHS,10,0,0,0,,船长！ 收到求救讯号
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.64,0:03:41.48,CHS,11,0,0,0,,求救！ 这是牵牛星六的马鲁号
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.65,0:03:44.74,CHS,12,0,0,0,,我们碰到引力地雷， 动力全失
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.82,0:03:54.28,CHS,13,0,0,0,,我们是企业号， 请指示座标
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.46,0:03:57.66,CHS,14,0,0,0,,我们的位置是GH第十段
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.97,0:04:00.23,CHS,15,0,0,0,,在中立地带
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.40,0:04:05.34,CHS,16,0,0,0,,船身穿洞， 维生系统失灵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.51,0:04:07.17,CHS,17,0,0,0,,马鲁号的资料
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.34,0:04:13.01,CHS,18,0,0,0,,三等中子燃料运输机乘客81300
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.48,0:04:15.51,CHS,19,0,0,0,,该死！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.18,0:04:20.42,CHS,20,0,0,0,,苏洛？准备进入轨道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:25.02,CHS,21,0,0,0,,恕我多言， 若星舰进入地带...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.19,0:04:28.06,CHS,22,0,0,0,,我知道自己的责任
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.20,0:04:35.96,CHS,23,0,0,0,,两分钟后抵达
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.14,0:04:43.67,CHS,24,0,0,0,,- 进入中立地带  - 警告， 进入中立地带
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.41,0:04:46.64,CHS,25,0,0,0,,我们违反了协定
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.85,0:04:49.78,CHS,26,0,0,0,,输送室准备把生还者接上船
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.95,0:04:52.71,CHS,27,0,0,0,,船长！ 失去了他们的讯号
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.19,0:04:57.49,CHS,28,0,0,0,,感应器显示三艘克林冈舰艇驶近
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.66,0:04:59.79,CHS,29,0,0,0,,- 迅速移近   - 传送影像
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.06,0:05:03.19,CHS,30,0,0,0,,进入作战状态， 启动防护罩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.63,0:05:07.90,CHS,31,0,0,0,,- 已经启动   - 说出我们在救人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.07,0:05:12.06,CHS,32,0,0,0,,- 他们干扰频道   - 他们开始袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.77,0:05:15.50,CHS,33,0,0,0,,我给搞糊涂了， 快离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.68,0:05:20.41,CHS,34,0,0,0,,警报！ 克林冈人发射鱼雷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.61,0:05:22.61,CHS,35,0,0,0,,马上逃走！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.99,0:05:30.08,CHS,36,0,0,0,,- 损毁报告   - 主动力器被击中
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.26,0:05:33.25,CHS,37,0,0,0,,启动辅助动力！ 准备还击！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.53,0:05:38.66,CHS,38,0,0,0,,防护罩被毁！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.37,0:05:45.63,CHS,39,0,0,0,,- 发射激光炮！   -  没有动力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.54,0:05:53.71,CHS,40,0,0,0,,没用的  我们死定了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.78,0:06:00.31,CHS,41,0,0,0,,启动逃生舱和救生浮标， 弃船
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.52,0:06:02.22,CHS,42,0,0,0,,打开它
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.23,0:06:15.00,CHS,43,0,0,0,,- 有何建议？   - 祈祷吧， 莎维
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.17,0:06:17.64,CHS,44,0,0,0,,克林冈人不会俘虏人的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.84,0:06:20.64,CHS,45,0,0,0,,开灯！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.81,0:06:22.50,CHS,46,0,0,0,,启动摩打
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.91,0:06:26.44,CHS,47,0,0,0,,船长？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.75,0:06:33.72,CHS,48,0,0,0,,训练员到简报室去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:38.08,CHS,49,0,0,0,,维修队到模拟控制室报到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.26,0:06:41.25,CHS,50,0,0,0,,维修队到模拟控制室报到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.43,0:06:44.96,CHS,51,0,0,0,,- 先治好自己   - 你只想说这些？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.13,0:06:48.00,CHS,52,0,0,0,,- 我的演技如何？   - 我不是影评
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.60,0:06:52.54,CHS,53,0,0,0,,你要跟沉船共存亡吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.71,0:06:56.30,CHS,54,0,0,0,,- 请批准我直言   - 我批准
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.48,0:07:00.17,CHS,55,0,0,0,,这并不能公平测试我的指挥能力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.38,0:07:03.35,CHS,56,0,0,0,,我无法获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.55,0:07:06.42,CHS,57,0,0,0,,所有指挥官都可能会面对绝境
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.59,0:07:10.68,CHS,58,0,0,0,,- 你从没遇过吗？   - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.86,0:07:16.63,CHS,59,0,0,0,,处理死亡跟处理生命一样重要
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.80,0:07:19.99,CHS,60,0,0,0,,我从没想过
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.17,0:07:22.83,CHS,61,0,0,0,,现在你可以想了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.11,0:07:31.37,CHS,62,0,0,0,,起用有经验的队员会否较好？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.55,0:07:35.28,CHS,63,0,0,0,,在宇宙飞驰是年轻人的玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.32,0:07:38.72,CHS,64,0,0,0,,什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.69,0:07:47.46,CHS,65,0,0,0,,你不是死了的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.23,0:07:54.22,CHS,66,0,0,0,,想知道我给学员的效率评分吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.40,0:07:57.00,CHS,67,0,0,0,,我很好奇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.17,0:08:00.54,CHS,68,0,0,0,,他们摧毁了模拟控制室和你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.71,0:08:03.40,CHS,69,0,0,0,,马鲁号事件经常摧毁...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.58,0:08:09.52,CHS,70,0,0,0,,机件和学员， 你也考了三次
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.68,0:08:13.02,CHS,71,0,0,0,,最后的解决方法很独特
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.19,0:08:15.75,CHS,72,0,0,0,,功效未经验证
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.92,0:08:19.42,CHS,73,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.59,0:08:21.99,CHS,74,0,0,0,,我知道你喜爱古董
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.66,0:08:27.76,CHS,75,0,0,0,,这是最好的， 也是最坏的年代
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.94,0:08:31.00,CHS,76,0,0,0,,- 有什么讯息？   - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.17,0:08:35.57,CHS,77,0,0,0,,除了生日快乐， 是最好的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.74,0:08:40.77,CHS,78,0,0,0,,冼朴队长， 太空船15分钟后出发
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.98,0:08:43.01,CHS,79,0,0,0,,- 你要去哪里？   - 企业号
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.22,0:08:46.65,CHS,80,0,0,0,,我要在你检阅前报到， 你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.69,0:08:50.45,CHS,81,0,0,0,,回家
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.07,0:09:10.44,CHS,82,0,0,0,,医生！ 什么风吹你来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.61,0:09:13.44,CHS,83,0,0,0,,小心带着礼物的罗武伦人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.85,0:09:18.72,CHS,84,0,0,0,,- 生日快乐   - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.82,0:09:24.99,CHS,85,0,0,0,,罗武伦酒， 你明知这是违法的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.16,0:09:28.49,CHS,86,0,0,0,,纯为药用， 我上了一艘船
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.66,0:09:31.83,CHS,87,0,0,0,,它带来一箱， 然后走过中立地带
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.00,0:09:34.52,CHS,88,0,0,0,,- 别那样死板   - 2283年
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:37.86,CHS,89,0,0,0,,这东西要一段时间发酵
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.04,0:09:41.87,CHS,90,0,0,0,,给我， 你打开这个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.91,0:09:44.97,CHS,91,0,0,0,,我几乎有点怕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.18,0:09:48.41,CHS,92,0,0,0,,是克林冈人的春药吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.62,0:09:50.08,CHS,93,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.28,0:09:54.85,CHS,94,0,0,0,,实在太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.02,0:09:59.05,CHS,95,0,0,0,,我向像你般的病人推荐视网五号
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.23,0:10:02.49,CHS,96,0,0,0,,- 我对它会敏感的   - 对， 干杯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.66,0:10:04.26,CHS,97,0,0,0,,干杯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.64,0:10:15.37,CHS,98,0,0,0,,生日快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.51,0:10:21.35,CHS,99,0,0,0,,- 我不知该说什么   - 说谢谢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.55,0:10:23.02,CHS,100,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.62,0:10:31.52,CHS,101,0,0,0,,可恶， 你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.69,0:10:34.29,CHS,102,0,0,0,,你的生日干嘛像葬礼一般？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.46,0:10:38.86,CHS,103,0,0,0,,- 我不想听教训   - 你想怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.57,0:10:46.56,CHS,104,0,0,0,,你不是年龄的问题， 你知的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.74,0:10:50.97,CHS,105,0,0,0,,你想翱翔天际， 却只能控制电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.14,0:10:54.20,CHS,106,0,0,0,,别发表伟论， 各人有自己的职责
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.41,0:11:00.94,CHS,107,0,0,0,,你在逃避， 躲在规章背后
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.52,0:11:05.42,CHS,108,0,0,0,,- 我在逃避谁？   - 你自己
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.53,0:11:14.80,CHS,109,0,0,0,,有话直说， 你在想什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.64,0:11:19.90,CHS,110,0,0,0,,占
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.24,0:11:24.61,CHS,111,0,0,0,,我是你的医生和朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.75,0:11:28.31,CHS,112,0,0,0,,重返指挥岗位吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.52,0:11:31.88,CHS,113,0,0,0,,在你变成他们的一分子之前
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.52,0:11:36.18,CHS,114,0,0,0,,你真的变老前
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.07,0:11:56.53,CHS,115,0,0,0,,航行日志， 星际日期8130.4
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.71,0:11:59.44,CHS,116,0,0,0,,大副柴可夫登录
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.65,0:12:03.17,CHS,117,0,0,0,,星舰信心号正驶向CA6星
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.38,0:12:05.94,CHS,118,0,0,0,,执行创世计划
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.15,0:12:09.78,CHS,119,0,0,0,,我们不断寻找无生命的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:14.19,CHS,120,0,0,0,,作为实验场所， 暂时还没成功
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.36,0:12:19.23,CHS,121,0,0,0,,标准轨道， 地面扫瞄有改变吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.40,0:12:24.43,CHS,122,0,0,0,,没有， 大气中只有克朗气体、 沙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.60,0:12:28.23,CHS,123,0,0,0,,和疾风， 无法支持生命体
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.01,0:12:32.14,CHS,124,0,0,0,,肯定毫无生命？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.35,0:12:34.47,CHS,125,0,0,0,,你有发现吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.68,0:12:39.02,CHS,126,0,0,0,,扫瞄器接收到微弱的能量流
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.19,0:12:43.42,CHS,127,0,0,0,,你肯定吗？也许扫瞄器有偏差
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.82,0:12:47.89,CHS,128,0,0,0,,可能是生命前期物质的分子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.06,0:12:50.39,CHS,129,0,0,0,,埋藏在母体组织内
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.56,0:12:53.90,CHS,130,0,0,0,,向马博士发出通讯图像
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.17,0:12:58.87,CHS,131,0,0,0,,我们或可利用它进行移植
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.04,0:13:01.06,CHS,132,0,0,0,,你知道她会怎样说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.24,0:13:06.08,CHS,133,0,0,0,,废话少说， 你要进行移植？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.28,0:13:08.65,CHS,134,0,0,0,,进行移植？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.98,0:13:12.65,CHS,135,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.82,0:13:15.45,CHS,136,0,0,0,,那可能是生命前期物质的分子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:20.22,CHS,137,0,0,0,,也可能不是， 你们要搞清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.39,0:13:23.92,CHS,138,0,0,0,,即使只是细菌， 也会很麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.10,0:13:27.43,CHS,139,0,0,0,,去看一下， 但若它可带它回来...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.60,0:13:29.40,CHS,140,0,0,0,,当然， 我们去了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.88,0:13:37.44,CHS,141,0,0,0,,别担心， 创世是可行的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.58,0:13:41.01,CHS,142,0,0,0,,你会跟牛津和爱因斯坦相提并论
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.18,0:13:44.17,CHS,143,0,0,0,,谢谢， 只是儿子却不尊重我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.38,0:13:48.18,CHS,144,0,0,0,,世界很公平的， 一起吃晚饭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.36,0:13:50.05,CHS,145,0,0,0,,也许
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.22,0:13:51.92,CHS,146,0,0,0,,你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.23,0:13:56.89,CHS,147,0,0,0,,每次跟舰队接触， 我都很紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.10,0:14:00.62,CHS,148,0,0,0,,我们在做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.80,0:14:03.93,CHS,149,0,0,0,,若处理不善， 会变成可怕的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.61,0:14:09.44,CHS,150,0,0,0,,你认识的空谈家正是这类人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.61,0:14:15.78,CHS,151,0,0,0,,却克绝对不是空谈家
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.85,0:14:20.48,CHS,152,0,0,0,,泰利船长， 准备传送
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.53,0:14:38.30,CHS,153,0,0,0,,你肯定座标正确吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.47,0:14:42.84,CHS,154,0,0,0,,这是CA6最好的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.48,0:14:46.54,CHS,155,0,0,0,,我几乎看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.99,0:15:00.86,CHS,156,0,0,0,,这里啥也没有， 三相器定是坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.57,0:15:17.07,CHS,157,0,0,0,,柴可夫， 这边！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.38,0:15:26.38,CHS,158,0,0,0,,看来像是货物运输机
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.40,0:15:38.73,CHS,159,0,0,0,,帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.10,0:16:20.23,CHS,160,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.41,0:16:23.31,CHS,161,0,0,0,,若是坠机的话， 其余残骸在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.36,0:16:39.05,CHS,162,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.24,0:16:51.97,CHS,163,0,0,0,,（植物舱）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.14,0:16:53.97,CHS,164,0,0,0,,植物舱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.31,0:16:57.21,CHS,165,0,0,0,,植物舱？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.21,0:17:00.08,CHS,166,0,0,0,,糟糕！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.15,0:17:03.14,CHS,167,0,0,0,,马上离开这里！ 该死！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.35,0:17:06.34,CHS,168,0,0,0,,- 那个...   - 别管了， 快走！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.55,0:17:09.11,CHS,169,0,0,0,,柴可夫， 你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.29,0:17:10.48,CHS,170,0,0,0,,柴可夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.52,0:17:13.32,CHS,171,0,0,0,,快走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.24,0:17:30.90,CHS,172,0,0,0,,信心号叫泰利船长
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.08,0:17:34.10,CHS,173,0,0,0,,我是卡莉指挥官， 请回话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.25,0:17:39.22,CHS,174,0,0,0,,泰利船长！ 请回话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.92,0:17:46.69,CHS,175,0,0,0,,再等一会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:21.72,CHS,176,0,0,0,,是简！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.94,0:18:38.74,CHS,177,0,0,0,,我不认识你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.29,0:18:48.08,CHS,178,0,0,0,,可是你...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.26,0:18:51.59,CHS,179,0,0,0,,我这人过目不忘
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.76,0:18:53.09,CHS,180,0,0,0,,你是...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.23,0:18:56.82,CHS,181,0,0,0,,柴可夫
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.00,0:18:59.46,CHS,182,0,0,0,,对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.57,0:19:05.06,CHS,183,0,0,0,,我没想过会再见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.24,0:19:08.77,CHS,184,0,0,0,,- 这人是谁？   - 是罪犯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.94,0:19:12.38,CHS,185,0,0,0,,20世纪末遗传工程学的产物
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.58,0:19:15.95,CHS,186,0,0,0,,- 你想怎样？我要求...   - 你现在
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.12,0:19:18.88,CHS,187,0,0,0,,没权要求什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.69,0:19:26.72,CHS,188,0,0,0,,我亦不会给予什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.89,0:19:31.09,CHS,189,0,0,0,,你看到的是植物舱硕果仅存的...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.26,0:19:33.29,CHS,190,0,0,0,,船员
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.47,0:19:39.06,CHS,191,0,0,0,,15年前， 我们被却克船长放逐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.24,0:19:42.57,CHS,192,0,0,0,,- 你们这群男女听着...   - 船长！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.88,0:19:48.87,CHS,193,0,0,0,,省口气吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.75,0:19:54.15,CHS,194,0,0,0,,二百年前， 你还没出生时
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.32,0:19:57.26,CHS,195,0,0,0,,他们誓死效忠于我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.63,0:20:01.86,CHS,196,0,0,0,,他从没有跟你说起吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.53,0:20:06.06,CHS,197,0,0,0,,用来逗你的船长高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.74,0:20:12.76,CHS,198,0,0,0,,说说企业号如何在1996年
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.94,0:20:18.74,CHS,199,0,0,0,,把我和船员接收
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.91,0:20:21.85,CHS,200,0,0,0,,- 我不认识却克上将   - 上将？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.95,0:20:24.31,CHS,201,0,0,0,,上将？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.49,0:20:26.92,CHS,202,0,0,0,,上将
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.62,0:20:37.96,CHS,203,0,0,0,,没说起却克上将如何把我们...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.13,0:20:41.29,CHS,204,0,0,0,,放逐到这个荒漠
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.47,0:20:46.03,CHS,205,0,0,0,,要我们只靠货舱里的东西维生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.21,0:20:49.87,CHS,206,0,0,0,,胡说， CA5是有生命的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.04,0:20:53.17,CHS,207,0,0,0,,- 非常公平   - 这里就是CA5
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.92,0:21:08.35,CHS,208,0,0,0,,我们来到这里半年， CA6就爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.43,0:21:15.10,CHS,209,0,0,0,,震荡改变星球轨迹， 一切都损毁
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.27,0:21:20.43,CHS,210,0,0,0,,却克上将没察看我们的发展
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.94,0:21:29.04,CHS,211,0,0,0,,全靠程式赋予我的智慧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.25,0:21:31.65,CHS,212,0,0,0,,我们才活到今天
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.02,0:21:37.51,CHS,213,0,0,0,,在地球上
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.13,0:21:42.29,CHS,214,0,0,0,,二百年前
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.56,0:21:45.83,CHS,215,0,0,0,,我是王子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.67,0:21:49.73,CHS,216,0,0,0,,权倾天下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.90,0:21:54.31,CHS,217,0,0,0,,却克船长招呼你， 你以怨报德
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.47,0:21:57.77,CHS,218,0,0,0,,企图偷他的船和谋杀他！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.39,0:22:10.75,CHS,219,0,0,0,,你没料到会找到我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.92,0:22:15.42,CHS,220,0,0,0,,你以为这里是CA6
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.83,0:22:22.13,CHS,221,0,0,0,,你为何要来这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.11,0:22:33.48,CHS,222,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.02,0:22:45.25,CHS,223,0,0,0,,容我介绍， 这是CA5仅存的...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.43,0:22:48.59,CHS,224,0,0,0,,本土生命体
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.97,0:23:02.34,CHS,225,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.51,0:23:04.81,CHS,226,0,0,0,,它们杀了我20个子民
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.68,0:23:09.34,CHS,227,0,0,0,,包括我的爱妻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.20,0:23:27.33,CHS,228,0,0,0,,他们不是同一时间死去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.04,0:23:35.13,CHS,229,0,0,0,,也绝非马上死去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.82,0:23:52.59,CHS,230,0,0,0,,幼虫爬进耳朵里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.76,0:23:56.32,CHS,231,0,0,0,,藏身在大脑皮层内
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.50,0:24:00.26,CHS,232,0,0,0,,受到影响的受害人...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.43,0:24:02.42,CHS,233,0,0,0,,会听命于人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.50,0:24:08.00,CHS,234,0,0,0,,然后， 幼虫长大
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.01,0:24:12.07,CHS,235,0,0,0,,他们会发疯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.01,0:24:16.04,CHS,236,0,0,0,,最后死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.56,0:24:25.49,CHS,237,0,0,0,,简！ 你听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.66,0:24:29.12,CHS,238,0,0,0,,它们当然是宠物
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.90,0:24:35.49,CHS,239,0,0,0,,只是不太驯服
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.50,0:24:40.17,CHS,240,0,0,0,,却克船长不过是履行职责
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.21,0:24:42.94,CHS,241,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.77,0:25:11.40,CHS,242,0,0,0,,好一点了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.27,0:25:17.71,CHS,243,0,0,0,,告诉我...你们为何要来这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.88,0:25:20.90,CHS,244,0,0,0,,以及可以在哪里...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.01,0:25:23.95,CHS,245,0,0,0,,找到却克
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.29,0:25:29.25,CHS,246,0,0,0,,企业号叫却克上将的飞船
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.42,0:25:33.12,CHS,247,0,0,0,,你可以停泊， 靠近舷边鱼雷舱
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.23,0:25:39.53,CHS,248,0,0,0,,却克上将一队来到
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.70,0:25:42.76,CHS,249,0,0,0,,企业号欢迎你， 准备停泊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.12,0:25:59.08,CHS,250,0,0,0,,我讨厌检阅
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.39,0:26:04.19,CHS,251,0,0,0,,我很高兴有机会登上企业号
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.57,0:26:16.90,CHS,252,0,0,0,,很高兴你能掌舵三星期
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.07,0:26:18.63,CHS,253,0,0,0,,这些孩子不会掌舵
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.99,0:26:37.75,CHS,254,0,0,0,,打开气塞
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.93,0:26:43.06,CHS,255,0,0,0,,- 请批准上船   - 你认识训练员
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.23,0:26:45.22,CHS,256,0,0,0,,他们当然认识你
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.40,0:26:48.16,CHS,257,0,0,0,,对， 我们曾同生共死
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.67,0:26:55.94,CHS,258,0,0,0,,史葛， 你这小子， 你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.11,0:26:59.60,CHS,259,0,0,0,,我有点恐惧， 但麦医生帮我克服
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.81,0:27:03.27,CHS,260,0,0,0,,- 害怕什么？   - 上岸
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.79,0:27:09.08,CHS,261,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？   - 一等海军学生
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.26,0:27:13.16,CHS,262,0,0,0,,- 工程助手贝彼得   - 首次航行？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.33,0:27:15.76,CHS,263,0,0,0,,- 是的   - 原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.16,0:27:20.33,CHS,264,0,0,0,,我们从引擎室开始吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.50,0:27:22.76,CHS,265,0,0,0,,里面见， 状况都很良好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.94,0:27:25.40,CHS,266,0,0,0,,实在令人惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.44,0:27:31.04,CHS,267,0,0,0,,待会在控制室见， 解散
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.32,0:27:43.55,CHS,268,0,0,0,,他不像我预期中那样
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.72,0:27:46.66,CHS,269,0,0,0,,他有什么地方让你意想不到？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.83,0:27:49.95,CHS,270,0,0,0,,他很富...人性
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.13,0:27:52.65,CHS,271,0,0,0,,莎维， 没有人是完美的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.13,0:28:28.09,CHS,272,0,0,0,,你的学员可以应付训练巡航吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.27,0:28:31.86,CHS,273,0,0,0,,- 请发命令   - 可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.91,0:28:35.97,CHS,274,0,0,0,,你还要检阅其他部门
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.14,0:28:38.11,CHS,275,0,0,0,,稍后才继续
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.86,0:28:54.05,CHS,276,0,0,0,,这里是总部， 企业号可以起程
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.23,0:28:56.13,CHS,277,0,0,0,,上将在控制室
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.18,0:29:15.58,CHS,278,0,0,0,,莎维， 可以清场
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.42,0:29:21.22,CHS,279,0,0,0,,- 已经清场   - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.99,0:29:30.16,CHS,280,0,0,0,,你曾驾驶星舰离开码头吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.16,0:29:33.56,CHS,281,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.84,0:29:44.50,CHS,282,0,0,0,,出发吧， 莎维
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.41,0:29:48.85,CHS,283,0,0,0,,知道
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.52,0:30:01.55,CHS,284,0,0,0,,凡事总有第一次， 对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.60,0:30:05.46,CHS,285,0,0,0,,- 船尾火箭推进器   - 知道
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.73,0:30:11.40,CHS,286,0,0,0,,- 要吃镇定剂吗？   - 加大推动力
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.04,0:31:27.27,CHS,287,0,0,0,,- 我们可以航行了   - 方向是？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.48,0:31:30.57,CHS,288,0,0,0,,由船长决定
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.28,0:31:36.15,CHS,289,0,0,0,,苏洛先生？由你作主吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.36,0:31:38.79,CHS,290,0,0,0,,知道
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.92,0:32:06.18,CHS,291,0,0,0,,仅此而已？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.35,0:32:10.12,CHS,292,0,0,0,,资料库满了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.26,0:32:14.06,CHS,293,0,0,0,,- 下次设计大一点的   - 谁造的？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.23,0:32:18.46,CHS,294,0,0,0,,马博士， 有人传送通讯图像
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.63,0:32:23.03,CHS,295,0,0,0,,- 是信心号   - 播出来看看
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.20,0:32:26.97,CHS,296,0,0,0,,请回覆， 信心号叫正规一号
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.77,0:32:32.07,CHS,297,0,0,0,,重复， 这里是美国军舰信心号
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.24,0:32:36.04,CHS,298,0,0,0,,正规一号收到， 请继续
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.25,0:32:42.31,CHS,299,0,0,0,,我们正朝着你方进发， 三天后到
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.49,0:32:47.02,CHS,300,0,0,0,,为什么？你该在三个月后回来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.19,0:32:52.26,CHS,301,0,0,0,,- 有什么不妥   - 已经找到CA6
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.77,0:32:56.57,CHS,302,0,0,0,,- 我不懂为何你...   - 收到新命令
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.74,0:33:01.26,CHS,303,0,0,0,,抵达后， 关于创世计划的资料...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.44,0:33:05.71,CHS,304,0,0,0,,都要传送到船上， 在CA6测试
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.88,0:33:08.28,CHS,305,0,0,0,,他们以为自己是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.48,0:33:11.88,CHS,306,0,0,0,,指挥官， 这样做不合常规
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.02,0:33:16.61,CHS,307,0,0,0,,- 这是任务   - 别理他， 妈
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.79,0:33:17.95,CHS,308,0,0,0,,是谁下的命令？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.36,0:33:25.66,CHS,309,0,0,0,,是却克上将下的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.83,0:33:28.80,CHS,310,0,0,0,,我早知道！ 军方只想抢...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.97,0:33:31.90,CHS,311,0,0,0,,这样做不合常规
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.07,0:33:36.24,CHS,312,0,0,0,,我不容许任何未经授权的人...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.41,0:33:38.24,CHS,313,0,0,0,,接触我们的资料
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.08,0:33:44.45,CHS,314,0,0,0,,很抱歉， 这是上将的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.08,0:33:50.15,CHS,315,0,0,0,,预备创世计划的资料， 通话完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.99,0:33:55.29,CHS,316,0,0,0,,做得好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.96,0:34:00.73,CHS,317,0,0,0,,他们会尝试联络却克上将
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.83,0:34:02.73,CHS,318,0,0,0,,确定指令
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.51,0:34:17.48,CHS,319,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.05,0:34:21.52,CHS,320,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.42,0:34:27.48,CHS,321,0,0,0,,你梳了不同的发型
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.66,0:34:29.86,CHS,322,0,0,0,,依然合符规则
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.63,0:34:34.39,CHS,323,0,0,0,,我可以说话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.54,0:34:39.53,CHS,324,0,0,0,,自我表达不是你的弱项
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.94,0:34:47.47,CHS,325,0,0,0,,你备受在马鲁号的表现困扰
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.68,0:34:51.84,CHS,326,0,0,0,,- 我解决不了   - 那是性格测试
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.25,0:34:55.95,CHS,327,0,0,0,,我可以问你是如何处理吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.59,0:35:00.32,CHS,328,0,0,0,,你可以问
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.96,0:35:05.02,CHS,329,0,0,0,,我在说笑
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.20,0:35:08.66,CHS,330,0,0,0,,幽默是难以理解的概念
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.74,0:35:14.47,CHS,331,0,0,0,,- 不合逻辑   - 我们从实践中学习
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.64,0:35:17.13,CHS,332,0,0,0,,是谁霸占着升降机？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.55,0:35:23.11,CHS,333,0,0,0,,- 她改变了发型吗？   - 我没留意
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.32,0:35:25.98,CHS,334,0,0,0,,罗武伦酒真是好酒
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.19,0:35:29.02,CHS,335,0,0,0,,- 却克上将？   - 我是
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.19,0:35:33.96,CHS,336,0,0,0,,太空实验室的马博士有急事找你
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.20,0:35:41.93,CHS,337,0,0,0,,- 我在办公室里听   - 来势汹汹
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.04,0:35:48.60,CHS,338,0,0,0,,你该知道挖旧疮疤的危险
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.11,0:35:54.24,CHS,339,0,0,0,,- 对不起   - 你听到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.45,0:35:58.41,CHS,340,0,0,0,,我听见， 发生什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.62,0:36:02.28,CHS,341,0,0,0,,你为何要把创世计划抢走
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.45,0:36:06.29,CHS,342,0,0,0,,谁要把创世计划抢走？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.46,0:36:09.69,CHS,343,0,0,0,,- 我听不到你说什么   - 嘉露
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.86,0:36:15.20,CHS,344,0,0,0,,- 是你下令的吗？   - 什么命令？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.37,0:36:21.07,CHS,345,0,0,0,,帮帮我们！ 我不会随便交出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.24,0:36:23.40,CHS,346,0,0,0,,他们凭什么这样做？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.58,0:36:26.54,CHS,347,0,0,0,,- 没有人这样做   - 帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.71,0:36:30.20,CHS,348,0,0,0,,- 发生什么事？   - 传送受干扰
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.45,0:36:39.15,CHS,349,0,0,0,,通知总部， 我要跟指挥部联络
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.93,0:36:43.55,CHS,350,0,0,0,,先别打乱阵脚， 一定有误会
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.73,0:36:47.13,CHS,351,0,0,0,,误会？我们孤身上路
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.30,0:36:50.06,CHS,352,0,0,0,,他们待大家都休假时才这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.24,0:36:52.93,CHS,353,0,0,0,,信心号应该由我们支配
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.11,0:36:55.87,CHS,354,0,0,0,,- 总部肯定不会...   - 我知道...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.04,0:37:00.74,CHS,355,0,0,0,,科学家总是军方的棋子
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.88,0:37:02.47,CHS,356,0,0,0,,一百年来， 舰队都相安无事
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.68,0:37:06.52,CHS,357,0,0,0,,我无法赞同你对事件的诠释
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.55,0:37:12.79,CHS,358,0,0,0,,你说得对， 但信心号已经上路
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.97,0:37:29.10,CHS,359,0,0,0,,正规一号有麻烦， 我们要调查
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.81,0:37:35.14,CHS,360,0,0,0,,正规一号是科研实验室
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.35,0:37:39.22,CHS,361,0,0,0,,我跟总部说过， 船上的都是孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.62,0:37:43.85,CHS,362,0,0,0,,但我们是这区内唯一的星舰
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.19,0:37:50.56,CHS,363,0,0,0,,你的学员面对压力时反应如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.73,0:37:55.22,CHS,364,0,0,0,,跟所有生物一样， 看天资而定
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.40,0:37:58.13,CHS,365,0,0,0,,当然， 这是你的船
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.17,0:38:04.04,CHS,366,0,0,0,,不必了， 送我到正规一号就行
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.21,0:38:09.15,CHS,367,0,0,0,,在训练时， 我乐意指挥企业号
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.31,0:38:15.18,CHS,368,0,0,0,,但执行任务时要由高级长官指挥
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.35,0:38:17.19,CHS,369,0,0,0,,也许没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.22,0:38:22.42,CHS,370,0,0,0,,只是通讯有误， 你掌舵吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.59,0:38:25.93,CHS,371,0,0,0,,你做了错误的假设
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.97,0:38:30.53,CHS,372,0,0,0,,我是火神星人， 没有自我意识
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.41,0:38:37.00,CHS,373,0,0,0,,你提醒我用逻辑支配行动？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.18,0:38:40.91,CHS,374,0,0,0,,我不会提起你早已清楚的事
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.11,0:38:45.88,CHS,375,0,0,0,,恕我直言， 你接受升职是错误的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.02,0:38:50.48,CHS,376,0,0,0,,指挥星舰是你的天命和专长
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.69,0:38:54.59,CHS,377,0,0,0,,其他职责都是浪费人才
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.76,0:38:57.42,CHS,378,0,0,0,,我不会跟你争辩
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.60,0:38:59.66,CHS,379,0,0,0,,明智的做法
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.83,0:39:04.39,CHS,380,0,0,0,,无论如何， 逻辑清楚显示...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.57,0:39:07.40,CHS,381,0,0,0,,多数人的福祉比少数人...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.74,0:39:11.68,CHS,382,0,0,0,,或一个人重要
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.45,0:39:21.78,CHS,383,0,0,0,,你是我的上司， 也是我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.95,0:39:25.15,CHS,384,0,0,0,,我永远是你的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.06,0:39:31.33,CHS,385,0,0,0,,关掉动力器， 启动扬声器
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.03,0:39:38.76,CHS,386,0,0,0,,紧急情况， 根据指挥部的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.94,0:39:42.67,CHS,387,0,0,0,,下午六时， 我接管星舰的指挥权
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.11,0:39:45.63,CHS,388,0,0,0,,职务官， 记录在案， 更改航道
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.81,0:39:48.30,CHS,389,0,0,0,,到太空实验所正规一号， 引擎室
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.58,0:39:53.64,CHS,390,0,0,0,,史葛！ 使用翘速飞行
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.42,0:39:59.08,CHS,391,0,0,0,,- 航道已更改   - 翘速引擎已启动
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.26,0:40:02.85,CHS,392,0,0,0,,- 准备翘速飞行   - 准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.26,0:40:09.63,CHS,393,0,0,0,,我知大家都没经验， 很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.80,0:40:13.20,CHS,394,0,0,0,,我要你们快点成长
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.21,0:40:16.00,CHS,395,0,0,0,,五倍翘速
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.91,0:40:20.31,CHS,396,0,0,0,,训练航程结速了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.15,0:40:32.89,CHS,397,0,0,0,,拦截企业号的航道已准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.06,0:40:36.08,CHS,398,0,0,0,,- 希曼？   - 我想说句话
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.53,0:40:43.66,CHS,399,0,0,0,,我们都效忠于你
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.84,0:40:46.39,CHS,400,0,0,0,,但你想想
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.47,0:40:53.10,CHS,401,0,0,0,,我们拥有飞船， 爱到哪里都可
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.28,0:40:56.37,CHS,402,0,0,0,,还摆脱了永久放逐的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.92,0:41:01.51,CHS,403,0,0,0,,你已证明了自己的雄才伟略
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.72,0:41:04.52,CHS,404,0,0,0,,挫败了却克上将的计划
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.56,0:41:08.65,CHS,405,0,0,0,,实在无须再次打败他
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.83,0:41:11.39,CHS,406,0,0,0,,他折磨我
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.56,0:41:14.66,CHS,407,0,0,0,,他折磨我， 我要报仇
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.87,0:41:19.03,CHS,408,0,0,0,,就算要追到天涯海角
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.20,0:41:24.67,CHS,409,0,0,0,,我也要找他算帐
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.84,0:41:30.65,CHS,410,0,0,0,,永不放弃， 准备改变航道
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.75,0:41:35.78,CHS,411,0,0,0,,正规一号太空站， 请回覆
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.99,0:41:38.29,CHS,412,0,0,0,,马博士， 请回答
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.79,0:41:42.89,CHS,413,0,0,0,,这是企业号
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.93,0:41:46.63,CHS,414,0,0,0,,没有反应
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.80,0:41:50.33,CHS,415,0,0,0,,- 已经没有干扰？   - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.34,0:42:02.87,CHS,416,0,0,0,,他们可能无法回覆， 或不愿回覆
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.08,0:42:06.74,CHS,417,0,0,0,,- 距离多远？   - 12小时43分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.72,0:42:14.82,CHS,418,0,0,0,,她说要交出创世计划， 交给谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.99,0:42:20.76,CHS,419,0,0,0,,若我知何谓创世计划， 或会有用
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.93,0:42:24.03,CHS,420,0,0,0,,乌拉， 请麦医生到我的办公室
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.20,0:42:27.76,CHS,421,0,0,0,,莎维， 你来指挥
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.78,0:42:36.80,CHS,422,0,0,0,,病房已准备好， 发生什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.82,0:42:42.34,CHS,423,0,0,0,,电脑， 启动保密程序
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.55,0:42:44.95,CHS,424,0,0,0,,存取创世计划的摘要
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.59,0:42:48.18,CHS,425,0,0,0,,视网膜扫瞄， 核对身份
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.36,0:42:50.69,CHS,426,0,0,0,,却克上将
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.87,0:42:58.27,CHS,427,0,0,0,,（视网膜、 动脉和静脉吻合）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.44,0:43:00.96,CHS,428,0,0,0,,通过保安扫瞄
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.14,0:43:02.30,CHS,429,0,0,0,,摘要？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.47,0:43:04.50,CHS,430,0,0,0,,（安全影带， 录影日期7130.4）
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.64,0:43:06.54,CHS,431,0,0,0,,（介绍）
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.71,0:43:10.17,CHS,432,0,0,0,,创世计划， 星盟的提案
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.35,0:43:13.68,CHS,433,0,0,0,,- 马嘉露   - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.85,0:43:15.91,CHS,434,0,0,0,,什么是创世？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.02,0:43:21.79,CHS,435,0,0,0,,创世是从无生命中创造生命
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.06,0:43:26.39,CHS,436,0,0,0,,把分子组织在次原子阶段重组
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.57,0:43:31.73,CHS,437,0,0,0,,生产相同重量的物质
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.90,0:43:35.10,CHS,438,0,0,0,,实验的首阶段在实验室进行
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.27,0:43:39.40,CHS,439,0,0,0,,次阶段会在无生命的地底进行
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.58,0:43:43.74,CHS,440,0,0,0,,第三阶段的范围扩大至一个星球
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.95,0:43:47.04,CHS,441,0,0,0,,我们意图把创世仪器
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.25,0:43:53.05,CHS,442,0,0,0,,放到预先选好的无生命天体
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.23,0:43:56.22,CHS,443,0,0,0,,仪器装好后， 马上产生...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.39,0:43:59.16,CHS,444,0,0,0,,创世效应
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.33,0:44:03.03,CHS,445,0,0,0,,物质重组， 创造生命
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.75,0:44:21.65,CHS,446,0,0,0,,月球不再死寂， 变成生机勃发
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.82,0:44:26.26,CHS,447,0,0,0,,可以供养我们送到那里的生命体
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.86,0:44:27.92,CHS,448,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.09,0:44:33.43,CHS,449,0,0,0,,这个模拟月球示范创世的潜力
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.60,0:44:38.66,CHS,450,0,0,0,,若星盟愿意资助实验
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.84,0:44:43.24,CHS,451,0,0,0,,看看宇宙面对的人口和粮食问题
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.41,0:44:46.24,CHS,452,0,0,0,,就能看到这个实验的好处
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.41,0:44:49.94,CHS,453,0,0,0,,建议书到此为止， 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.72,0:44:53.48,CHS,454,0,0,0,,是名副其实的创世
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.62,0:44:56.95,CHS,455,0,0,0,,创造的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.82,0:45:02.12,CHS,456,0,0,0,,- 开始了没？   - 录影是两年前的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.29,0:45:05.99,CHS,457,0,0,0,,我估计实验进行到次阶段
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.16,0:45:10.33,CHS,458,0,0,0,,但你认为我们有没有足够的智慧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.50,0:45:15.27,CHS,459,0,0,0,,若这实验在有生命的地方展开
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.44,0:45:19.64,CHS,460,0,0,0,,新母体就会把原有生命摧毁
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.18,0:45:25.14,CHS,461,0,0,0,,新母体？你知道自己在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.35,0:45:29.31,CHS,462,0,0,0,,我不会评估它的道德含意
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.52,0:45:34.58,CHS,463,0,0,0,,在历史上， 摧毁总比创造容易
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.76,0:45:38.06,CHS,464,0,0,0,,错了！ 现在两者可以同时进行
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.23,0:45:41.22,CHS,465,0,0,0,,据神话记载， 地球在六天内完成
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.40,0:45:45.67,CHS,466,0,0,0,,创世出现后， 六分钟就够了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.84,0:45:50.00,CHS,467,0,0,0,,麦医生， 你得学会控制情绪
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.18,0:45:53.58,CHS,468,0,0,0,,否则会招致失败， 逻辑说...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.75,0:45:57.55,CHS,469,0,0,0,,天啊！ 这人还在说逻辑
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.75,0:45:59.98,CHS,470,0,0,0,,这是宇宙末日
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.09,0:46:04.32,CHS,471,0,0,0,,- 你这冷血的...   - 指挥部叫上将
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.49,0:46:09.02,CHS,472,0,0,0,,有一艘飞船向我方快速移近
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.19,0:46:14.43,CHS,473,0,0,0,,- 对方是谁？   - 是信心号
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.57,0:46:19.83,CHS,474,0,0,0,,尝试使用紧急频道
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.51,0:46:25.70,CHS,475,0,0,0,,传送图像
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.39,0:46:41.69,CHS,476,0,0,0,,（信心号）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.86,0:46:44.35,CHS,477,0,0,0,,把推动力减半
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.10,0:46:50.09,CHS,478,0,0,0,,- 当个朋友吧   - 推动力减半
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.27,0:46:54.76,CHS,479,0,0,0,,信心号跟我们在同区， 正在减速
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.94,0:46:59.24,CHS,480,0,0,0,,规例第12条指任何飞船驶近
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.41,0:47:01.90,CHS,481,0,0,0,,若无法通讯的话...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.11,0:47:05.71,CHS,482,0,0,0,,上将很清楚规例
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.92,0:47:07.21,CHS,483,0,0,0,,知道
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.02,0:47:13.55,CHS,484,0,0,0,,他们的通讯系统会不会坏了？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.59,0:47:16.32,CHS,485,0,0,0,,这会解释很多东西
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.49,0:47:19.73,CHS,486,0,0,0,,他们要求通讯
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.90,0:47:21.46,CHS,487,0,0,0,,别理他们！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.64,0:47:26.10,CHS,488,0,0,0,,他们的防护罩依然关上
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.27,0:47:29.71,CHS,489,0,0,0,,当然， 我们是快乐的舰队
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.78,0:47:37.54,CHS,490,0,0,0,,却克， 老朋友， 克林冈谚语说
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.75,0:47:42.05,CHS,491,0,0,0,,君子报仇， 十年未晚
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.56,0:47:49.08,CHS,492,0,0,0,,太空是最佳的复仇场所
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.94,0:48:00.96,CHS,493,0,0,0,,非常不妥
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.87,0:48:05.31,CHS,494,0,0,0,,- 黄色戒备   - 启动防卫场
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.05,0:48:16.99,CHS,495,0,0,0,,对方说通讯系统负荷过重
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.12,0:48:21.52,CHS,496,0,0,0,,检查， 感应线的放射正常
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.40,0:48:28.23,CHS,497,0,0,0,,- 防护罩没升起   - 启动防护罩
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.67,0:48:33.66,CHS,498,0,0,0,,- 他们升起防护罩   - 锁定目标
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.97,0:48:36.57,CHS,499,0,0,0,,锁定目标
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.74,0:48:38.68,CHS,500,0,0,0,,- 他们瞄准我们   - 启动防护罩
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.84,0:48:40.04,CHS,501,0,0,0,,发射！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.83,0:48:57.06,CHS,502,0,0,0,,- 马上把防护罩升起   - 我在尝试
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.49,0:49:22.51,CHS,503,0,0,0,,没有动力
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.49,0:49:26.25,CHS,504,0,0,0,,史葛？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.42,0:49:29.22,CHS,505,0,0,0,,- 把频道关上   - 史葛要通话
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.39,0:49:34.30,CHS,506,0,0,0,,我们在坚持着， 主动力器毁坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.47,0:49:37.76,CHS,507,0,0,0,,- 启动辅助动力   - 知道
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.94,0:49:39.43,CHS,508,0,0,0,,损毁报告
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.54,0:49:51.61,CHS,509,0,0,0,,- 他们清楚我们的弱点   - 是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.82,0:49:55.58,CHS,510,0,0,0,,我们无法单凭辅助动力逃跑
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.62,0:49:58.85,CHS,511,0,0,0,,传送影像！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.59,0:50:03.79,CHS,512,0,0,0,,- 把动力分给激光炮   - 太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.96,0:50:05.55,CHS,513,0,0,0,,坚持着！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.54,0:50:19.10,CHS,514,0,0,0,,史葛！ 还剩下什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.28,0:50:22.77,CHS,515,0,0,0,,只有电池， 辅助动力快可启动
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.98,0:50:25.42,CHS,516,0,0,0,,没时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.22,0:50:34.19,CHS,517,0,0,0,,- 可以发炮吗？   - 只能发几炮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.36,0:50:36.83,CHS,518,0,0,0,,- 未能攻破护罩   - 他们是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.00,0:50:40.29,CHS,519,0,0,0,,上将！ 信心号指挥官发出信号
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.47,0:50:42.99,CHS,520,0,0,0,,他要商讨投降的条件
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.34,0:50:55.11,CHS,521,0,0,0,,传送影像
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.31,0:50:58.44,CHS,522,0,0,0,,趁我们还有时间
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.96,0:51:06.18,CHS,523,0,0,0,,已经传送了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.83,0:51:18.93,CHS,524,0,0,0,,- 是简！   -  你还记得我
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.10,0:51:21.73,CHS,525,0,0,0,,教人感激不尽
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.91,0:51:24.37,CHS,526,0,0,0,,我当然记得你
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.54,0:51:28.71,CHS,527,0,0,0,,为何要攻击我们？船员在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.91,0:51:32.44,CHS,528,0,0,0,,我的意图非常简单
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.65,0:51:36.02,CHS,529,0,0,0,,我要找你报仇雪恨
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.19,0:51:41.68,CHS,530,0,0,0,,使飞船失去动力， 还要取你性命
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.03,0:51:48.23,CHS,531,0,0,0,,首先我让你知道自己败给谁
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.70,0:51:51.17,CHS,532,0,0,0,,简
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.17,0:51:55.77,CHS,533,0,0,0,,你要的人是我
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.94,0:51:59.71,CHS,534,0,0,0,,我愿意到你的船上， 放了其他人
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.88,0:52:05.14,CHS,535,0,0,0,,我另有提议， 我会同意这条件
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.35,0:52:10.25,CHS,536,0,0,0,,但除了你本人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.42,0:52:15.76,CHS,537,0,0,0,,你还得把创世的资料带给我
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.43,0:52:20.39,CHS,538,0,0,0,,- 创世？   - 别侮辱我的智慧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.00,0:52:23.76,CHS,539,0,0,0,,给我一点时间搜寻资料
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.44,0:52:27.50,CHS,540,0,0,0,,我给你一分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.54,0:52:35.34,CHS,541,0,0,0,,大家离开指挥部
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.49,0:52:43.82,CHS,542,0,0,0,,至少创世计划还不在他手上
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.99,0:52:47.01,CHS,543,0,0,0,,继续点头， 装作在听我的吩咐
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.19,0:52:50.56,CHS,544,0,0,0,,显示信心号控制室的数据图
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.20,0:52:53.60,CHS,545,0,0,0,,- 快点   - 45秒
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.77,0:52:55.60,CHS,546,0,0,0,,密码是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.94,0:53:04.50,CHS,547,0,0,0,,- 这是数据图   - 上将！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.64,0:53:06.23,CHS,548,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.25,0:53:10.31,CHS,549,0,0,0,,- 上将   - 求求你
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.52,0:53:14.92,CHS,550,0,0,0,,稍等一会， 电脑失灵了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.09,0:53:17.68,CHS,551,0,0,0,,时间是你得不到的奢侈品
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.23,0:53:26.46,CHS,552,0,0,0,,可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.73,0:53:30.79,CHS,553,0,0,0,,- 上将   - 正传送过来
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.07,0:53:38.67,CHS,554,0,0,0,,信心号的密码是16309
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.84,0:53:40.28,CHS,555,0,0,0,,我不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.44,0:53:43.38,CHS,556,0,0,0,,你要学习星舰的处事方式
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.55,0:53:45.68,CHS,557,0,0,0,,每艘船都有自己的代号
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.88,0:53:48.85,CHS,558,0,0,0,,为防止敌人侵占船只
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.22,0:53:54.82,CHS,559,0,0,0,,我们在这里下令信心号卸下护罩
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.99,0:53:58.22,CHS,560,0,0,0,,但愿他没改密码
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.40,0:54:00.56,CHS,561,0,0,0,,15秒
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.14,0:54:07.76,CHS,562,0,0,0,,我怎知道你不会食言？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.94,0:54:11.03,CHS,563,0,0,0,,我没承诺过什么
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.21,0:54:14.27,CHS,564,0,0,0,,只是你没有选择余地
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.58,0:54:20.14,CHS,565,0,0,0,,我懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.35,0:54:23.18,CHS,566,0,0,0,,准备接收传送吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.49,0:54:27.95,CHS,567,0,0,0,,将激光炮瞄准目标， 听候命令
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.36,0:54:33.09,CHS,568,0,0,0,,时间到了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.26,0:54:34.60,CHS,569,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.00,0:54:37.06,CHS,570,0,0,0,,动手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.94,0:54:46.03,CHS,571,0,0,0,,我们的防护罩在下降
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.18,0:54:49.74,CHS,572,0,0,0,,升起它！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.82,0:54:52.98,CHS,573,0,0,0,,我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.12,0:54:56.35,CHS,574,0,0,0,,人手操控装置在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.52,0:54:58.22,CHS,575,0,0,0,,开火！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.32,0:55:01.59,CHS,576,0,0,0,,发射！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.60,0:55:08.36,CHS,577,0,0,0,,开火！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.53,0:55:10.93,CHS,578,0,0,0,,- 不行   - 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.10,0:55:15.47,CHS,579,0,0,0,,他们破坏了翘速仪， 快点撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.64,0:55:17.73,CHS,580,0,0,0,,- 不！   -  一定要
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.75,0:55:28.95,CHS,581,0,0,0,,企业号那里都不能去
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.53,0:55:40.46,CHS,582,0,0,0,,- 你成功了！   -  我没有
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.53,0:55:46.49,CHS,583,0,0,0,,我太掉以轻心， 我老了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.67,0:55:50.90,CHS,584,0,0,0,,莎维， 你继续引用条例
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.08,0:55:54.07,CHS,585,0,0,0,,我们去看看损毁程度
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.86,0:56:46.30,CHS,586,0,0,0,,- 请发命令   - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.93,0:56:49.37,CHS,587,0,0,0,,翘速飞行
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.84,0:56:52.93,CHS,588,0,0,0,,知道
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.05,0:57:10.99,CHS,589,0,0,0,,所有学员都跑了， 他仍紧守岗位
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.19,0:57:15.12,CHS,590,0,0,0,,- 上将， 我是冼朴   - 什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.29,0:57:18.06,CHS,591,0,0,0,,引擎室说辅助动力恢复正常
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.23,0:57:21.32,CHS,592,0,0,0,,我们可以启动推动力前进
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.50,0:57:23.93,CHS,593,0,0,0,,用最快的速度驶向正规一号
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.10,0:57:26.19,CHS,594,0,0,0,,我很难过
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.04,0:57:31.17,CHS,595,0,0,0,,驶向太空实验室正规一号
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.34,0:57:36.14,CHS,596,0,0,0,,正规一号， 这是企业号， 请通话
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.65,0:57:42.31,CHS,597,0,0,0,,正规一号， 听到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.26,0:57:49.25,CHS,598,0,0,0,,正规一号， 这是企业号， 请通话
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.13,0:57:53.65,CHS,599,0,0,0,,这是企业号， 听到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.27,0:58:00.00,CHS,600,0,0,0,,正规一号， 听到吗？请通话
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.07,0:58:03.10,CHS,601,0,0,0,,没有反应
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.05,0:58:08.34,CHS,602,0,0,0,,感应器的情况怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.55,0:58:13.38,CHS,603,0,0,0,,仍然失灵， 无法探测内部情况
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.55,0:58:16.52,CHS,604,0,0,0,,无法探测信心号的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.36,0:58:19.65,CHS,605,0,0,0,,你对这个小行星有什么认识？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.82,0:58:22.52,CHS,606,0,0,0,,正规星是丁级星
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.63,0:58:28.50,CHS,607,0,0,0,,包括其寻常矿石， 是一块大石
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.67,0:58:32.66,CHS,608,0,0,0,,- 信心号可能在石后   - 很有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.71,0:58:36.51,CHS,609,0,0,0,,- 工程室？   - 知道
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.68,0:58:39.87,CHS,610,0,0,0,,动力够不够启动运输机？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.91,0:58:42.61,CHS,611,0,0,0,,仅仅足够
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.22,0:58:47.55,CHS,612,0,0,0,,- 我要进去   - 简或在里面！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.72,0:58:51.16,CHS,613,0,0,0,,他未找到所需东西， 谁有空？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.33,0:58:52.69,CHS,614,0,0,0,,我有空
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.86,0:58:56.96,CHS,615,0,0,0,,规则说没有武装人员陪同下
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.13,0:58:59.73,CHS,616,0,0,0,,不得擅自走进危险地区
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.90,0:59:01.39,CHS,617,0,0,0,,根本没有这条规矩！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.44,0:59:08.93,CHS,618,0,0,0,,一起走吧， 冼朴， 你来掌舵
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.11,0:59:11.01,CHS,619,0,0,0,,万事小心
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.11,0:59:13.14,CHS,620,0,0,0,,我们会！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.17,0:59:39.54,CHS,621,0,0,0,,不确定的生命迹象
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.81,0:59:45.01,CHS,622,0,0,0,,拿出激光枪
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.18,0:59:49.65,CHS,623,0,0,0,,行动
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.25,1:00:56.58,CHS,624,0,0,0,,占！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.56,1:01:10.22,CHS,625,0,0,0,,还未僵硬， 刚死去不久
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.27,1:01:12.32,CHS,626,0,0,0,,嘉露
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.50,1:01:16.46,CHS,627,0,0,0,,企业号叫正规一号， 请通话
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.07,1:01:19.60,CHS,628,0,0,0,,上将！ 在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.77,1:01:22.26,CHS,629,0,0,0,,马博士， 请通话！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.80,1:01:48.06,CHS,630,0,0,0,,天啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.24,1:01:50.60,CHS,631,0,0,0,,请确认信号
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.77,1:01:56.61,CHS,632,0,0,0,,我是莎维副官， 一切安好
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.05,1:02:01.88,CHS,633,0,0,0,,长官， 是简！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.05,1:02:04.85,CHS,634,0,0,0,,- 我们在CA5找到他   - 冷静
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.45,1:02:10.98,CHS,635,0,0,0,,他把生物植入我们体内
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.19,1:02:13.39,CHS,636,0,0,0,,控制我们的思想
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.63,1:02:16.82,CHS,637,0,0,0,,没事了， 你安全了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.00,1:02:20.09,CHS,638,0,0,0,,使我们说谎
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.13,1:02:26.66,CHS,639,0,0,0,,我们打败了他， 他不能控制我们
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.84,1:02:29.60,CHS,640,0,0,0,,- 船长很强壮   - 船长
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.64,1:02:35.34,CHS,641,0,0,0,,马博士和创世的资料在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.55,1:02:39.28,CHS,642,0,0,0,,他找不到， 资料库也是空的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.49,1:02:43.89,CHS,643,0,0,0,,- 清除了？   - 他折磨那些人
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.06,1:02:47.93,CHS,644,0,0,0,,但大家都守口如瓶， 他气炸了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.10,1:02:54.19,CHS,645,0,0,0,,把他们杀死， 还想捣毁这里
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.37,1:02:59.53,CHS,646,0,0,0,,但太迟了， 他要赶回信心号
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.71,1:03:02.17,CHS,647,0,0,0,,信心号的船员死了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.04,1:03:07.21,CHS,648,0,0,0,,被遗弃在CA5星上
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.38,1:03:11.08,CHS,649,0,0,0,,他疯了， 说你害死他妻子
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.29,1:03:13.75,CHS,650,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.69,1:03:23.65,CHS,651,0,0,0,,逃生舱还在， 传送室在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.20,1:03:28.46,CHS,652,0,0,0,,- 他来到这里？   - 不是的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.64,1:03:32.30,CHS,653,0,0,0,,他在迫人招供时， 花了很多时间
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.84,1:03:38.61,CHS,654,0,0,0,,机器还开着， 所有人都死了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.78,1:03:43.24,CHS,655,0,0,0,,他们以生命换取运走资料的时间
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.45,1:03:48.15,CHS,656,0,0,0,,没道理， 这些座标在正规星深处
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.32,1:03:50.31,CHS,657,0,0,0,,这小星球没有生命
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.53,1:03:56.76,CHS,658,0,0,0,,若次阶段已完成， 该在地下
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.93,1:04:00.92,CHS,659,0,0,0,,- 是地下   - 什么次阶段？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.64,1:04:04.93,CHS,660,0,0,0,,- 却克叫企业号   - 我是冼朴
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.11,1:04:07.07,CHS,661,0,0,0,,损毁报告
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.24,1:04:13.61,CHS,662,0,0,0,,若依书直说， 你会觉得度日如年
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.98,1:04:18.42,CHS,663,0,0,0,,- 有话直说   - 情况很严峻
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.59,1:04:21.18,CHS,664,0,0,0,,主动力在六天后才能恢复
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.39,1:04:24.19,CHS,665,0,0,0,,辅助动力暂时失灵
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.36,1:04:29.76,CHS,666,0,0,0,,按常规， 要两天后才能修理
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.93,1:04:31.90,CHS,667,0,0,0,,无法把我们送回船上？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.07,1:04:34.06,CHS,668,0,0,0,,暂时不能
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.30,1:04:40.00,CHS,669,0,0,0,,若一小时内没有我们的消息
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.17,1:04:42.47,CHS,670,0,0,0,,就尽量修复动力系统
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.21,1:04:45.74,CHS,671,0,0,0,,把企业号驶到最近的基地
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.91,1:04:48.47,CHS,672,0,0,0,,离开干扰范围后， 马上通知总部
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.65,1:04:50.91,CHS,673,0,0,0,,我们不能丢下你不管
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.12,1:04:55.21,CHS,674,0,0,0,,若失去联络， 就表示无人生还
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.89,1:04:59.62,CHS,675,0,0,0,,你们可以留下来...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.79,1:05:03.70,CHS,676,0,0,0,,我们愿意共同承担危险
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.73,1:05:07.33,CHS,677,0,0,0,,好， 走吧， 莎维
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.00,1:05:12.10,CHS,678,0,0,0,,- 走到哪里去？   - 他们去的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.51,1:05:16.77,CHS,679,0,0,0,,若他们哪儿都没去呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.94,1:05:19.88,CHS,680,0,0,0,,那这是逃走的好机会
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.74,1:05:51.11,CHS,681,0,0,0,,上将
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.33,1:06:07.45,CHS,682,0,0,0,,是创世吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.10,1:06:16.73,CHS,683,0,0,0,,放下武器！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.07,1:06:19.33,CHS,684,0,0,0,,你！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.61,1:06:30.01,CHS,685,0,0,0,,- 马博士在哪？   - 我就是了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.22,1:06:31.78,CHS,686,0,0,0,,占
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.83,1:06:46.20,CHS,687,0,0,0,,他是大卫吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.37,1:06:49.67,CHS,688,0,0,0,,妈！ 他把余下的人杀光了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.14,1:06:56.04,CHS,689,0,0,0,,他不会的， 别把事情越弄越复杂
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.21,1:06:59.91,CHS,690,0,0,0,,比你想像中更复杂
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.08,1:07:02.98,CHS,691,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.48,1:07:04.75,CHS,692,0,0,0,,柴可夫！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.95,1:07:08.35,CHS,693,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.62,1:07:12.46,CHS,694,0,0,0,,大人， 你听到吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.76,1:07:19.89,CHS,695,0,0,0,,听到了， 你做得很好
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.07,1:07:23.16,CHS,696,0,0,0,,我早知道， 混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.80,1:07:29.30,CHS,697,0,0,0,,- 别动   - 船长， 我们在等着
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.34,1:07:33.31,CHS,698,0,0,0,,- 为何要延误？   - 没事
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.48,1:07:35.64,CHS,699,0,0,0,,你有传送创世的座标
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.85,1:07:40.58,CHS,700,0,0,0,,先办妥最重要的事
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.99,1:07:45.65,CHS,701,0,0,0,,把却克上将干掉
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.30,1:07:58.86,CHS,702,0,0,0,,我难以下手， 我...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.04,1:08:02.53,CHS,703,0,0,0,,- 我想遵从的， 但...   - 杀了他！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.08,1:08:04.24,CHS,704,0,0,0,,我...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.39,1:08:14.65,CHS,705,0,0,0,,马上杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.74,1:08:39.11,CHS,706,0,0,0,,天啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.18,1:08:42.98,CHS,707,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.27,1:09:04.57,CHS,708,0,0,0,,简！ 你这卑鄙小人！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.47,1:09:09.27,CHS,709,0,0,0,,有种就放马过来！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.11,1:09:13.70,CHS,710,0,0,0,,却克！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.02,1:09:19.47,CHS,711,0,0,0,,老朋友， 你还未死
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.69,1:09:26.52,CHS,712,0,0,0,,对， 老朋友！ 你几乎干掉所有人
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.69,1:09:30.93,CHS,713,0,0,0,,但却打不中目标
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.11,1:09:43.20,CHS,714,0,0,0,,我不用再尝试
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.52,1:09:51.81,CHS,715,0,0,0,,不能让他抢走
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.32,1:09:56.52,CHS,716,0,0,0,,简！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.53,1:10:04.36,CHS,717,0,0,0,,你得到创世， 却杀不了我
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.53,1:10:09.83,CHS,718,0,0,0,,你要杀我， 就要过来
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.87,1:10:13.81,CHS,719,0,0,0,,我要你比死更难受
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.44,1:10:17.77,CHS,720,0,0,0,,我伤害了你
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.25,1:10:22.94,CHS,721,0,0,0,,我要继续伤害你
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.95,1:10:28.22,CHS,722,0,0,0,,把你丢下， 像你丢下我一样
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.92,1:10:30.58,CHS,723,0,0,0,,像你丢下她一样
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.76,1:10:36.22,CHS,724,0,0,0,,永远被遗弃在死寂的星球上
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.76,1:10:39.60,CHS,725,0,0,0,,生葬！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.97,1:10:41.80,CHS,726,0,0,0,,生葬！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.07,1:10:44.66,CHS,727,0,0,0,,简！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.07,1:10:47.60,CHS,728,0,0,0,,简！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.91,1:10:57.87,CHS,729,0,0,0,,莎维叫企业号， 听到吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.99,1:11:04.65,CHS,730,0,0,0,,- 他醒来了   - 柴可夫？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.59,1:11:11.66,CHS,731,0,0,0,,没用的， 他们干扰了所有频道
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.83,1:11:14.46,CHS,732,0,0,0,,企业号遵从命令走了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.63,1:11:17.69,CHS,733,0,0,0,,若她跑不掉就死定了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.24,1:11:20.50,CHS,734,0,0,0,,跟我们一样
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.88,1:11:25.14,CHS,735,0,0,0,,我不明白！ 到底是什么一回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.21,1:11:27.44,CHS,736,0,0,0,,简是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.61,1:11:31.57,CHS,737,0,0,0,,- 说来话长   - 我们有的是时间
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.16,1:11:40.39,CHS,738,0,0,0,,有食物吗？我饿坏了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.56,1:11:43.03,CHS,739,0,0,0,,你怎么会想到食物的？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.20,1:11:46.03,CHS,740,0,0,0,,最重要的是活下去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.20,1:11:49.13,CHS,741,0,0,0,,创世洞穴内有食物
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.30,1:11:53.86,CHS,742,0,0,0,,有需要的话， 足够维持一辈子
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.94,1:11:56.47,CHS,743,0,0,0,,还以为这里是创世
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.91,1:12:03.04,CHS,744,0,0,0,,总部的工程师
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.25,1:12:05.81,CHS,745,0,0,0,,花了十个月才把这里挖好
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.52,1:12:11.51,CHS,746,0,0,0,,这里的工作却一天内完成
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.72,1:12:16.66,CHS,747,0,0,0,,让麦医生和副官看看我们的食物
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.83,1:12:21.86,CHS,748,0,0,0,,- 我们不能光坐着   - 可以的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.04,1:12:23.97,CHS,749,0,0,0,,总算是有事可做吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.97,1:12:29.31,CHS,750,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.92,1:12:40.98,CHS,751,0,0,0,,- 上将？   - 你的老师冼朴说
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.19,1:12:45.32,CHS,752,0,0,0,,凡事总有机会
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.74,1:13:00.21,CHS,753,0,0,0,,我如你所愿
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.37,1:13:02.03,CHS,754,0,0,0,,我走了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.38,1:13:06.35,CHS,755,0,0,0,,何不早跟我说？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.38,1:13:09.25,CHS,756,0,0,0,,你怎能这么说？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.48,1:13:12.85,CHS,757,0,0,0,,我们不是一起的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.02,1:13:15.32,CHS,758,0,0,0,,不是说好会一起的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.49,1:13:18.42,CHS,759,0,0,0,,我们各自拥有一片天
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.76,1:13:21.99,CHS,760,0,0,0,,我希望他留在我身旁
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.16,1:13:25.53,CHS,761,0,0,0,,而不是跟爸爸在宇宙间奔波
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.84,1:13:39.47,CHS,762,0,0,0,,他很像你
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.28,1:13:43.15,CHS,763,0,0,0,,很多方面都像
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.39,1:13:48.79,CHS,764,0,0,0,,你有什么感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.33,1:13:55.42,CHS,765,0,0,0,,那个男人
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.60,1:13:57.69,CHS,766,0,0,0,,他想杀我
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.90,1:14:02.77,CHS,767,0,0,0,,我的儿子却乐于帮助他
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.11,1:14:07.60,CHS,768,0,0,0,,儿子...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.64,1:14:13.77,CHS,769,0,0,0,,我的人生本可很丰盛
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.25,1:14:16.72,CHS,770,0,0,0,,事实却不然
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.49,1:14:21.61,CHS,771,0,0,0,,我的感觉？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.33,1:14:26.69,CHS,772,0,0,0,,衰老
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.16,1:14:32.15,CHS,773,0,0,0,,疲惫
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.34,1:14:40.67,CHS,774,0,0,0,,我给你看一些东西
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.91,1:14:46.68,CHS,775,0,0,0,,能使你返老还童
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.36,1:15:03.23,CHS,776,0,0,0,,推动力已修复
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.40,1:15:08.36,CHS,777,0,0,0,,好， 领先可怜的企业号
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.42,1:15:32.29,CHS,778,0,0,0,,你在一天内完成？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.46,1:15:35.05,CHS,779,0,0,0,,母体在一天内形成
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.23,1:15:40.33,CHS,780,0,0,0,,生命体极快速地成长
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.80,1:15:48.97,CHS,781,0,0,0,,很厉害， 你见过这样的情景吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.08,1:15:53.34,CHS,782,0,0,0,,我很厉害吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.30,1:16:13.73,CHS,783,0,0,0,,她在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.97,1:16:22.07,CHS,784,0,0,0,,我可以发问吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.24,1:16:25.54,CHS,785,0,0,0,,- 你在想什么？   - 马鲁号
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.71,1:16:28.04,CHS,786,0,0,0,,你想问现在像那情况吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.21,1:16:34.55,CHS,787,0,0,0,,我很想知道你如何应付那测试
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.72,1:16:38.92,CHS,788,0,0,0,,在所有星舰学员中
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.09,1:16:41.96,CHS,789,0,0,0,,唯有他能在绝境中求胜
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.13,1:16:44.22,CHS,790,0,0,0,,怎样做？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.40,1:16:48.46,CHS,791,0,0,0,,我把电脑程序改编， 拯救船只
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.63,1:16:50.76,CHS,792,0,0,0,,- 什么？   - 他作弊！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.94,1:16:53.57,CHS,793,0,0,0,,我更改测试条件
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.74,1:16:58.68,CHS,794,0,0,0,,他们赞扬我的想法， 我不爱输
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.85,1:17:02.84,CHS,795,0,0,0,,你不曾面对死亡？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.42,1:17:06.08,CHS,796,0,0,0,,我不相信有绝境
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.12,1:17:12.25,CHS,797,0,0,0,,- 两小时了， 准备好吗？   - 行了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.43,1:17:16.36,CHS,798,0,0,0,,请说出座标， 我们把你们送上来
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.43,1:17:22.23,CHS,799,0,0,0,,我不爱输
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.90,1:17:26.39,CHS,800,0,0,0,,但我们无法动弹， 要两天才修复
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.57,1:17:30.06,CHS,801,0,0,0,,从常规想想吧， 冼朴
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.24,1:17:32.51,CHS,802,0,0,0,,- 你认识马博士   - 当然
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.68,1:17:34.98,CHS,803,0,0,0,,- 我把他带到病房   - 常规？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.15,1:17:40.61,CHS,804,0,0,0,,46A， 若战时传送遭监听的话
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.82,1:17:43.38,CHS,805,0,0,0,,公开频道的讯息必须加密码
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.79,1:17:49.79,CHS,806,0,0,0,,- 你撒谎   - 夸张而已
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.96,1:17:53.90,CHS,807,0,0,0,,天代表小时， 分钟代表小时
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.94,1:18:01.46,CHS,808,0,0,0,,- 丙甲板失灵   - 有什么还能动？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.64,1:18:05.13,CHS,809,0,0,0,,部分主动力失灵， 两小时内修好
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.87,1:18:27.63,CHS,810,0,0,0,,- 上将在控制室   - 作战状态
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.67,1:18:31.93,CHS,811,0,0,0,,作战策略
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.04,1:18:40.51,CHS,812,0,0,0,,她的速度较快， 火力较大
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.48,1:18:46.14,CHS,813,0,0,0,,- 那是缪他星云   - 可以进去吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.35,1:18:50.19,CHS,814,0,0,0,,动力器还未修复， 别再被击中
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.36,1:18:53.99,CHS,815,0,0,0,,- 不能保证   - 星云的问题是...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.16,1:18:57.79,CHS,816,0,0,0,,静电和烟云会干扰显示器
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.96,1:19:00.93,CHS,817,0,0,0,,我们看不到东西， 也不能用护罩
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.17,1:19:04.64,CHS,818,0,0,0,,害己亦害人
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.27,1:19:07.86,CHS,819,0,0,0,,大家势均力敌
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.19,1:19:56.31,CHS,820,0,0,0,,她在那里！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.52,1:19:58.29,CHS,821,0,0,0,,她在那里！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.26,1:20:04.99,CHS,822,0,0,0,,损毁程度没我们想像中严重
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.16,1:20:06.72,CHS,823,0,0,0,,好极了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.92,1:20:36.45,CHS,824,0,0,0,,2.2分钟后进入星云
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.10,1:20:40.07,CHS,825,0,0,0,,信心号正迫近
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.61,1:20:51.13,CHS,826,0,0,0,,他们进去后就无法追踪
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.71,1:20:54.18,CHS,827,0,0,0,,教训他们
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.76,1:21:08.69,CHS,828,0,0,0,,- 好险   - 他们不想我们进去
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.57,1:21:18.16,CHS,829,0,0,0,,一分钟后进入星云
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.77,1:21:20.50,CHS,830,0,0,0,,干嘛要减速？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.64,1:21:26.13,CHS,831,0,0,0,,若进入星云， 保护罩就会失效
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.98,1:21:33.28,CHS,832,0,0,0,,- 他们在减速   - 给我连络他
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.22,1:21:37.69,CHS,833,0,0,0,,可以了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.86,1:21:42.73,CHS,834,0,0,0,,我是却克上将， 有兴趣重赛吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.83,1:21:47.82,CHS,835,0,0,0,,我在嘲笑你的...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.00,1:21:50.43,CHS,836,0,0,0,,“超人智慧”
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.94,1:21:55.87,CHS,837,0,0,0,,- 全速前进   - 不可以
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.04,1:21:58.81,CHS,838,0,0,0,,你得到创世， 已是万能了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.98,1:22:01.64,CHS,839,0,0,0,,全速前进！ 可恶！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.75,1:22:09.88,CHS,840,0,0,0,,他的性格始终如一
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.62,1:22:14.46,CHS,841,0,0,0,,我们正进入缪他星云
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.47,1:22:25.20,CHS,842,0,0,0,,紧急灯光
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.20,1:22:56.67,CHS,843,0,0,0,,战术
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.37,1:23:00.03,CHS,844,0,0,0,,失灵
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.04,1:23:05.53,CHS,845,0,0,0,,升起防护罩
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.71,1:23:10.17,CHS,846,0,0,0,,果然不行， 我在减速
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.73,1:23:54.16,CHS,847,0,0,0,,目标
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.33,1:23:57.78,CHS,848,0,0,0,,- 无法锁定目标   - 测量好就开火
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.17,1:24:09.04,CHS,849,0,0,0,,船尾鱼雷， 开火！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.78,1:24:19.75,CHS,850,0,0,0,,稳定航道
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.47,1:24:44.91,CHS,851,0,0,0,,右舷！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.35,1:24:55.98,CHS,852,0,0,0,,开火！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.48,1:25:19.14,CHS,853,0,0,0,,损毁报告
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.95,1:25:24.71,CHS,854,0,0,0,,我要把主要部分关掉
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.92,1:25:28.22,CHS,855,0,0,0,,- 幅射...   - 史葛？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.79,1:25:29.98,CHS,856,0,0,0,,尤金
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.79,1:25:36.73,CHS,857,0,0,0,,你是最...伟大的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.04,1:25:46.23,CHS,858,0,0,0,,我会替你报仇
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.68,1:25:59.41,CHS,859,0,0,0,,可以另觅人选吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.42,1:26:02.58,CHS,860,0,0,0,,柴可夫， 控制武器室
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.99,1:26:09.72,CHS,861,0,0,0,,- 冼朴   - 能源读数
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.90,1:26:13.30,CHS,862,0,0,0,,船尾左舷， 可能是转向
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.60,1:26:16.97,CHS,863,0,0,0,,他不肯罢手
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.10,1:26:20.83,CHS,864,0,0,0,,他跟纵了我那么久， 定会回来
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.71,1:26:25.14,CHS,865,0,0,0,,从哪里回来？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.31,1:26:28.77,CHS,866,0,0,0,,他很聪明， 但缺乏经验
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.95,1:26:32.88,CHS,867,0,0,0,,他使用二元思维模式
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.96,1:26:41.52,CHS,868,0,0,0,,- 停止   - 停止
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.36,1:26:45.73,CHS,869,0,0,0,,负一万米， 光子鱼雷候命
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.82,1:27:41.01,CHS,870,0,0,0,,鱼雷准备好了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.46,1:27:53.69,CHS,871,0,0,0,,注意
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.57,1:27:58.97,CHS,872,0,0,0,,开火！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.48,1:28:07.10,CHS,873,0,0,0,,开火！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.81,1:28:45.44,CHS,874,0,0,0,,给信心号指挥官发讯， 准备上船
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.65,1:28:46.88,CHS,875,0,0,0,,知道
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.35,1:28:50.65,CHS,876,0,0,0,,信心号指挥官， 这里是企业号
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.29,1:28:54.42,CHS,877,0,0,0,,快投降， 准备上船
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.59,1:28:59.22,CHS,878,0,0,0,,企业号叫信心号， 投降和弃船
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.78,1:29:16.34,CHS,879,0,0,0,,信心号， 我们命令你投降
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.52,1:29:21.08,CHS,880,0,0,0,,信心号， 我们命令你投降
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.40,1:29:37.63,CHS,881,0,0,0,,不， 却克
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.24,1:29:42.07,CHS,882,0,0,0,,游戏还没完结
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.71,1:30:21.65,CHS,883,0,0,0,,我会跟你拼到底！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.99,1:30:40.19,CHS,884,0,0,0,,探测到信心号有股能量
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.27,1:30:43.36,CHS,885,0,0,0,,我从没见过这模式
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.21,1:30:51.40,CHS,886,0,0,0,,- 是创世的电波   - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.58,1:30:54.05,CHS,887,0,0,0,,他们要引爆
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.45,1:30:58.44,CHS,888,0,0,0,,- 多久后？   -  四分钟
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.62,1:31:01.25,CHS,889,0,0,0,,- 我们要上船阻止他   - 不行
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.29,1:31:08.73,CHS,890,0,0,0,,三分钟后预备翘速飞行
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.16,1:31:12.53,CHS,891,0,0,0,,- 没反应   - 史葛
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.70,1:31:16.00,CHS,892,0,0,0,,苏洛， 尽快带我们离开这里
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.21,1:31:59.64,CHS,893,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？人类无法忍受那幅射
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.81,1:32:03.34,CHS,894,0,0,0,,你真是观察入微， 我不是人类
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.82,1:32:09.22,CHS,895,0,0,0,,- 你不能进去   - 你说得对
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.39,1:32:14.62,CHS,896,0,0,0,,- 史葛怎样了？   - 我想他...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.56,1:32:18.79,CHS,897,0,0,0,,对不起， 我没时间合理地解释
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.27,1:32:24.57,CHS,898,0,0,0,,记着
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.60,1:32:27.30,CHS,899,0,0,0,,（辐射）
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.45,1:32:38.38,CHS,900,0,0,0,,冼朴！ 快离开
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.85,1:32:40.51,CHS,901,0,0,0,,冼朴！ 出来！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.90,1:32:55.16,CHS,902,0,0,0,,- 时间？   - 两分钟零十秒
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.33,1:32:58.10,CHS,903,0,0,0,,引擎室！ 发生什么事？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.27,1:33:03.23,CHS,904,0,0,0,,- 冼朴   - 你快出来
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.41,1:33:07.24,CHS,905,0,0,0,,天啊， 不要！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.14,1:33:38.17,CHS,906,0,0,0,,时间？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.41,1:33:42.24,CHS,907,0,0,0,,3分30秒
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.02,1:33:51.72,CHS,908,0,0,0,,- 与信心号的距离？   -  四千公里
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.89,1:33:53.36,CHS,909,0,0,0,,我们逃不了吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.37,1:34:07.67,CHS,910,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.44,1:34:11.71,CHS,911,0,0,0,,你跑不了的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.35,1:34:18.44,CHS,912,0,0,0,,我从地狱把你干掉
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.39,1:34:27.62,CHS,913,0,0,0,,我用最后一口气唾骂你
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.34,1:34:43.93,CHS,914,0,0,0,,- 主电流回复了   - 好极， 走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.02,1:35:30.04,CHS,915,0,0,0,,嘉露， 你看
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.17,1:35:46.13,CHS,916,0,0,0,,引擎室？做得好， 史葛
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.24,1:35:51.11,CHS,917,0,0,0,,占， 你马上下来
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.28,1:35:55.91,CHS,918,0,0,0,,- 什么事？   - 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.42,1:36:01.61,CHS,919,0,0,0,,莎维， 你来控制
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.65,1:36:31.95,CHS,920,0,0,0,,不， 船舱会充满幅射！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.15,1:36:35.81,CHS,921,0,0,0,,- 他会死的   - 他已死了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.66,1:36:41.52,CHS,922,0,0,0,,太迟了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.82,1:37:04.91,CHS,923,0,0,0,,冼朴！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.68,1:37:39.88,CHS,924,0,0,0,,飞船脱险了吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.52,1:37:42.75,CHS,925,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.32,1:37:48.72,CHS,926,0,0,0,,别难过
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.20,1:37:52.89,CHS,927,0,0,0,,这很合符逻辑
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.30,1:37:59.60,CHS,928,0,0,0,,多数人的福祉...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.87,1:38:03.97,CHS,929,0,0,0,,比少数人...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.01,1:38:06.74,CHS,930,0,0,0,,或一个人的要紧
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.19,1:38:19.52,CHS,931,0,0,0,,我没接受马鲁号测验
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.13,1:38:22.82,CHS,932,0,0,0,,直到现在
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.70,1:38:27.69,CHS,933,0,0,0,,我的解决方法怎样？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.00,1:38:31.70,CHS,934,0,0,0,,冼朴！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.88,1:38:44.61,CHS,935,0,0,0,,我一直...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.82,1:38:47.28,CHS,936,0,0,0,,永远都是...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.49,1:38:49.25,CHS,937,0,0,0,,你的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.03,1:38:58.89,CHS,938,0,0,0,,长命百岁， 活得丰盛
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.19,1:39:22.41,CHS,939,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.51,1:39:48.04,CHS,940,0,0,0,,我们齐集在此， 作最后致敬
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.69,1:39:58.62,CHS,941,0,0,0,,尽管如此哀伤， 我们要记着
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.82,1:40:01.79,CHS,942,0,0,0,,死亡过后， 必有新生
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.96,1:40:04.45,CHS,943,0,0,0,,新世界定会出现
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.63,1:40:08.53,CHS,944,0,0,0,,我们的同伴以生命去保护它
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.07,1:40:13.47,CHS,945,0,0,0,,他没有白白牺牲
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.21,1:40:17.54,CHS,946,0,0,0,,我们不会质疑他的举动和智慧
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.91,1:40:23.31,CHS,947,0,0,0,,我只能说， 在我的朋友中
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.62,1:40:31.92,CHS,948,0,0,0,,在我航行以来认识的人中...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.96,1:40:34.62,CHS,949,0,0,0,,他最富...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.40,1:40:40.02,CHS,950,0,0,0,,人情味
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.37,1:40:43.60,CHS,951,0,0,0,,立正
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.05,1:42:09.45,CHS,952,0,0,0,,进来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.56,1:42:14.49,CHS,953,0,0,0,,我无意打扰你
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.66,1:42:19.43,CHS,954,0,0,0,,没有， 我要到控制室去
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.33,1:42:25.43,CHS,955,0,0,0,,- 我想跟你谈谈   - 要喝点什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.60,1:42:28.27,CHS,956,0,0,0,,莎维说得对
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.94,1:42:32.38,CHS,957,0,0,0,,你从没面对死亡
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.35,1:42:43.22,CHS,958,0,0,0,,不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.96,1:42:48.05,CHS,959,0,0,0,,我从没面对死亡
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.23,1:42:50.13,CHS,960,0,0,0,,我使诈
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.06,1:42:55.43,CHS,961,0,0,0,,运用谋略远离死亡
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.60,1:42:58.76,CHS,962,0,0,0,,把自己藏在计谋之后
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.74,1:43:05.64,CHS,963,0,0,0,,- 我什么也不懂   - 你跟莎维说
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.81,1:43:09.08,CHS,964,0,0,0,,处理死亡跟处理生命一样重要
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.72,1:43:14.71,CHS,965,0,0,0,,- 我说说而已   - 但说得好
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.22,1:43:20.99,CHS,966,0,0,0,,这番话能带出真理， 你该听从
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.70,1:43:28.00,CHS,967,0,0,0,,我看错了你， 对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.07,1:43:33.47,CHS,968,0,0,0,,你要说的就这么多？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.47,1:43:36.77,CHS,969,0,0,0,,大概是
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.15,1:43:47.38,CHS,970,0,0,0,,还有， 我很自豪
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.72,1:43:53.16,CHS,971,0,0,0,,能成为你的儿子
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.89,1:44:27.95,CHS,972,0,0,0,,航行日志， 星际日期8141.6
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.13,1:44:31.69,CHS,973,0,0,0,,企业号到CA5接应信心号船员
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.10,1:44:35.12,CHS,974,0,0,0,,大家都没事
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.30,1:44:38.70,CHS,975,0,0,0,,我不断想起我遗下的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.87,1:44:43.60,CHS,976,0,0,0,,冼朴说， 凡事总有机会
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.48,1:44:48.43,CHS,977,0,0,0,,若创世从死亡中创出生命
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.01,1:44:52.78,CHS,978,0,0,0,,那我一定要再来这里
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.36,1:45:02.42,CHS,979,0,0,0,,他没死， 他活在我们的记忆中
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.77,1:45:13.00,CHS,980,0,0,0,,这是我所做过最好的事
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.71,1:45:19.14,CHS,981,0,0,0,,一个以我所知道...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.31,1:45:22.61,CHS,982,0,0,0,,最好的安息之所
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.35,1:45:25.21,CHS,983,0,0,0,,那是诗吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.39,1:45:30.35,CHS,984,0,0,0,,是冼朴想在我生日上说的话
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.76,1:45:35.35,CHS,985,0,0,0,,你没事吧， 你觉得怎样？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.50,1:45:39.59,CHS,986,0,0,0,,年轻
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.04,1:45:46.60,CHS,987,0,0,0,,感觉很年轻
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.34,1:47:01.40,CHS,988,0,0,0,,太空， 最后的无人地带
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.48,1:47:08.21,CHS,989,0,0,0,,星舰企业号继续旅程
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.55,1:47:15.98,CHS,990,0,0,0,,她的任务是要开发新世界
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.16,1:47:20.89,CHS,991,0,0,0,,寻找新的生命与文明
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.27,1:47:27.21,CHS,992,0,0,0,,勇敢地朝无人曾踏足之地进发
